<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Kukũ Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">SAMUEL KUKŨ NYƆƆFA</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Samuel Kukũ Nyɔɔfa</char>, nle<char style="bk">Samuel kukũ kasale sitũ ɔkyɛ</char>, di Dawid sɛka ole fɛ ɔka okofolaa. Lɛkasale di Yuda kala-kasɔ suoto (disi 1- 4), ku kale nwu kamuu suoto, di Israel nsi ni kaamɛ di katoo-kasɔ (5-24). Kule nwaako ɔlaa di mmle di Dawid lanwini alɛ ɔɔkpɛnsa ni sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ, ankpee ni kayilakɔ nɔɔ osie. Aakpɛ ku balo di nnle nwu kamɛ, diɛkyakaa nii, ku bafɔɔ osie. Duotuo mmle di Dawid nle ni otii wɔ ofũ onu niekyofo ni ku suoto ɔyɔ ɔta Yaa ɔkpɛ ɔbla. Aale nnwɔ kafɔɔ niafuo ni batii nɔɔ anu obuo nwaa. Kafɔɔ kukũ nwu kotuo mmle di obe owo an-yɔ ni onunsie, ammiɛ alɛ ɔɔbla ni sikpile osie kanya an-yɔ ambla ni ɔkɔnsɔ akleesaa nɔɔ ku n-ya ɛɛtɛ ni ɔbla. Kafɔɔ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ Natan lalaadieko nwɔ ni ku sikpile nɔɔ ɔlaa yi, aadiki sĩ aabuɛ, aafũ kafɔɔ letoko naanfi le di Yaa latɔɔ nii aakpee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dawid nkpa ku asaa ya aafuo ni ɔbla labla Israel batii ɔkpɛ osie kanya, alɛ di dii kaamaa, di kale nwu nsi di nimiina kamɛ yi, boomiɛ ɔka bamba, aale nnwɔ nimale ni “Dawid obisuɔtɔbi”, dile ni Dawid ɔnantii wɔ nimate ni fɛle nnwɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Dawid sɛka ole di Yuda suoto 1.1-4.12</para>
  <para style="io1">Dawid sɛka ole di Israel omuu suoto 5.1-24.25</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Alɛɛ ya niale ni katũ 5.1-10.19</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Dawid ku Batseba 11.1-12.25</para>
  <para style="io2">ɔ. Dibuo ku amiina 12.26-20.26</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Alɛɛ ya niawɛ ni sɛɛmaa 21.1-24.25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lanu Saul Kukpi Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Di Saul kukpi kamaa, Dawid lakple di Amalek batii kalenkeekɔ, ni aasiɛ di Siklag ayi anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Di dii tiɛfa, osuɔtɔ onwii lakye Saul kasikɔ aawa ku akpeele bɛbɛɛle ku kudu di disi nɔɔ. Obe wɔ aabadu ni Dawid, aase katũ kaasɔ aatɔɔ dibu.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ feekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Otoso letoso di Israel batii kasikɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔkɔ mi, obe niɛwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bakpɛtɛ letoso di kakpɛ nwu. Kpinwu lɛma lɛnɔnɔɔ beekpi. Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan kafɔɔ ntookpi.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakaalɛ okosopo nwu niawako nwɔ ni kanya alɛ, “Lɛ fɛɛbla feetofo falɛ Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan ntookpi?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Ni di okosopo nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Lawɛ di Gilboa Kobokote osi, nfa di Saul lakulaa di lɛkplɔ nɔɔ suoto, di bakeke ku bakatɛ laloo ni otika di suoto nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Obe wɔ aamunikĩi aanyɛɛ nii, aalɛɛ mi, ni lakaalɛ nlɛ, 'Obe kamafuo ɔbla?’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />“Ni aakaalɛ mi alɛ, 'Owe fale?’ </para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">Ni labuɛ nlɛ, 'Amalek otii nle.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />"Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, 'Yila di suoto nii faalo mi! Nsi di kukpi kamɛ, kafɔɔ lekple nkpe nkpa.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Nioso layila di suoto nɔɔ lalo nwɔ, diekye latofo nlɛ atɔɔnɔɔ ni kamaa, ɔlɔbasinwɛ nkpa. Ni layɔ lɛkakoto le di disi nɔɔ ku okyinkla wɔ di kanɛɛtũ nɔɔ, ni lɛyɔ nya lɛwako saate nii nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Ninfɛ di Dawid ku batii ba bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ lamufũ akpeele lɛma baabɛbɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Baawi, baabla kaku, baanii kanya baata Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan ku SAATE nwu bakpɛtɛ ku Israel leyo dialaadu kɔtɔɔfɔ. Diekye baanɔɔ di kapamii kanya.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ okosopo wɔ niawako nwɔ ni kanya alɛ, “Ɔfɛ feekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Amalek otii onwii ɔfɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi nle.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Dawid lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso fatayɛkɛ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔtakatɛsa ɔwɔɔsa nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lalɛɛ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ onwii aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Kyɛ faalaasafɔ nwɔ fatɛ kaasɔ!” Nioso aalaasasafɔ nwɔ aatɛ kaasɔ, ni aakpi nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Diekye Dawid latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ntɔ lɛfɔ ditika di afɔ omu nsintɛɛ. Kanya lɛfɔ kamu nielo fɔ lɛpɔɔ, di obe wɔ faabuɛ ni falɛ, 'Ami nialo ni nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lasa Sikunu Aata Saul Ku Yonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Ni di Dawid lasa sikunu se mmle di Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan suoto nɛ, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />ni aabuɛ alɛ batuo Yuda batii kɔtaa sikunu se mmle (bɛɛkpana sĩ di Yasar Kukũ kamɛ):<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Oo Israel, beelo dibu lɛfɔ batii bɛɛtɛ di ntakalekɔ lɛfɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Lɛ di basientɛ nwu lɛnɔɔ!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />“Bitambuɛ nwu di Gat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">bitanyie nwu lɛkya di Askelon akpaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">alɛ Filisti batii babisankobi bapɔ́,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">alɛ mba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto babisankobi banya suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Oo Gilboa abokote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">bitanwɛ oblokyi ee kanto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">ee afe ya ninta ni asaaɔta atitabi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Diekye nfa baakpɔnɔfɔsa basientɛ kubidifunsaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">Saul kubidifunsaa-blɔbasinfifia ni ku nnɔnyi.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Di mba baalo ni ntɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">di basientɛ nwu suoto sina kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">di Yonatan kɔtaa nwu ditasinkple kuawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">Saul kapamii nwu ditasinkple kafukuti.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Saul ku Yonatan-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">di nkpa lɛma kamɛ, baabɔmbɔ ma, baatoobuo kafɔɔ batii anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">di kukpi kamɛ kafɔɔ, batablá ma di suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Baawɛ sɛwa baalenkee baklikpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">baawɛ osie baalenkee bakyata.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Oo Israel babisankobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">biwi bita Saul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">nnwɔ nianyukunsa ye ni abula sɛɛle ku asaa ya nialɛ ni onyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">nnwɔ niaklɛɛ ni akleesaa lee ku koto sɛɛle anyɛnɛ.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Lɛ di basientɛ nwu lɛnɔɔ di kakpɛ kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">beelo Yonatan bɛɛtɛ di ntakalekɔ lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Obiloo Yonatan, kowi nta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">faatɛ faafũ kɔya faatɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le faatɛɛ ni labla ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">diatɛ diabla ɔkpɛ dialenkee basanko lè le.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Lɛ di basientɛ nwu lɛnɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Kakpɛ akpɛsaa nwu ntɔɔwɔɔ!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Baase Dawid Sɛka Baata Yuda Leyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Di Saul ku Yonatan kukpi kamaa, Dawid lakaalɛ SAATE nwu alɛ, “Nkata nkyɛ Yuda sekpoo nwu owo kamɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Kata fakyɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ ninkyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ni di SAATE nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Hebron.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Nioso Dawid lakata aasifi nfa ku basɔfɔ nɔɔ nwu banyɔ, Ahinoam wɔ niakye ni Yesreel ku Abigail wɔ niale ni Nabal wɔ niakye ni Karmel kpisɔfɔ. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Dawid lakpaa kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ, obiala ku leyo nɔɔ batii, ni baalaasiɛ di Hebron ku sekpoo nisĩ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Ninfɛ di Yuda batii lawa Hebron, ni baapɛ Dawid ɔfɔɔ ninfa fɛ ɔka di Yuda leyo suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Dawid alɛ Yabes Gilead batii niakookaa ni Saul, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />ni aakpee batɔkyɛntɛ Yabes Gilead batii baalaatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “SAATE nwu awii ye lɛtɔtrɔ ku mmle biabla ni saate lee Saul sifutulɛ se mmle okle, biakookaa nwɔ ni. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />SAATE nwu abla sifutulɛ ku onukwale ole aata ye nunua, ami kafɔɔ kamale ye sebualɛ nwu okle ta biɛbla ni nle mmle oso. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Kanunua, biwɛ osie ku sɛkambi, diekye saate lee Saul ntookpi, Yuda leyo kafɔɔ ntɔɔpɛ mi ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di suoto lɛma.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baase Is-Boset Ɔka Baata Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Saul kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ, Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner lakpaa Saul obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset aawako Mahanaim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Ni aase nwɔ ɔka di Gilead, Asuri, Yesreel ku Efraim, Benyamin ku katoo kasɔ ka bɔɔlɛɛ ni Israel suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Saul obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset lafũ alɛɛ afosi-ana fiɛ aabale ɔka di Israel suoto, aale kafɔɔ sɛka alɛɛ anyɔ. Yuda leyo kafɔɔ latikanko Dawid. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Obe wɔ di Dawid lale ni ɔka di Hebron di Yuda leyo suoto labla alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ku awɛntɛ akuɔ.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner ku Saul obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset batii ladie di Mahanaim baasifi Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoab wɔ di ɔya niale ni Seruia ku Dawid bakpɛtɛ ladie baalaakyaka ku mma di Gibeon lɛpanta katũ. Dikudi ninwii lasiɛ di lɛpanta nwu lɛkyɛ ninwii, dikudi ninwii kafɔɔ di lɛkyɛ nyɔɔfa.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Ninfɛ di Abner latɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Ta buta bakosopo nwu bawo bataka baakpɛko bawo di anu loo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Ni di Yoab labuɛ alɛ, “Dilɛ, ta ma babla nkpo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Nioso baataka baayila baaka Benyamin ku Saul obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset bakpɛtɛ lefosi-banyɔ baadiki, Dawid kafɔɔ baaka lefosi-banyɔ baatɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ biala laminiko owo nɔɔ diisi aatofo nwɔ kapamii di difutukyɛ ni baasi baanɔɔ nɛ. Nioso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu di Gibeon alɛ Helkat Hasurim nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Dii nwu kakpɛ latɛ kaawɛ osie, ni di Dawid batii lalenkee Abner ku Israel batii nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Seruia babisuɔtɔbi batiɛ nwu lawɛ ninfa: Yoab, Abisai ku Asael. Ni di Asael nkpaa lapɛsɛwa fɛ kafɛ nle nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Ni aatikanko Abner, atamunikĩi afe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ di obe wɔ atikanko nwɔ nii. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abner lanyu sɛmaa nɔɔ ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Asael, afɔ dile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Ami dile.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ninfɛ di Abner latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Munikĩi di oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ; faakpɛko okosopo onwii faafũ akpɛsaa nɔɔ.” Kafɔɔ Asael ditadiɛ nwɔ otikanko.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abner lakple aafunaa Asael alɛ, “Diɛ mi otikanko! Be oso kalo fɔ ntɛ? Lɛ kafuo obilee Yoab onyu di anu?”<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Kafɔɔ Asael lasĩ, atadiɛ nwɔ otikanko; nioso Abner layɔ lɛkplɔ nɔɔ leto aatofo Asael kaafutu, ni di lɛkplɔ nwu labɔkɔtɛ di kamaa nɔɔ nɛ. Ni aanɔɔ ninfa, aakpi ninfa, ninfa nɛ. Nioso osuɔtɔ biala n-yila, nse eedu lɛba le di Asael lanɔɔ aakpi nii.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Kafɔɔ Yoab ku Abisai latikanko Abner, di kufĩ nfɛ latɔɔmɛɛ nii, baabadu Amma lekpenkpe, ninkaako ni Gia di Gibeon ɔfaafuu osuku. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Ninfɛ di Benyamin bakpɛtɛ layila Abner kamaa nɛ. Baabla dikudi ninwii baalaayila di lekpenkpe ninwii osi.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Ni di Abner lafaa aalɛɛ Yoab alɛ, “Dikpeni kapamii kalalaasa asaa dinaa ni kaloo? Bieye bilɛ nle mmle kamawako kalonkpɛɛ di kayɛntɛkɔ? Ɔmɛmbe fiɛ fabatɔkɔ batii lɛfɔ falɛ badiɛ babilɛma otikanko?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Ni di Yoab ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nwaako di Yaa lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nse fatankakatɛ, se basuɔtɔ nwu ntabanwini mantikanko babilɛma ninaadu kɔsɛɛ ku olesɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Nioso Yoab lafɛ kakyukyoe, ni di basuɔtɔ nwu bamuu layila nɛ; batasintikanko Israel ee bakple bakpɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Di kakyɛ nwu kamuu Abner ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lakyɛ baafe di Araba. Baawaalɛ Yordan, baafe baasifi Bitron omuu baawa Mahanaim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Ninfɛ di Yoab ladiɛ Abner otikanko, ni aasiisa bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu nɛ. Di Asael diesi ni kaamɛ, Dawid bakpɛtɛ lefosi-banaasĩ layu. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Kafɔɔ Dawid bakpɛtɛ lalo Benyamin bakpɛtɛ alafa-atiɛ, afosi-akuɔ ba niawɛ ni ku Abner. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Ni baayɔ Asael baalaakookaa di ote ɔkya kamɛ di Betlehem nɛ. Ninfɛ di Yoab ku batii nɔɔ lakyɛ kakyɛ nwu kamuu, baalaabuo Hebron ku kolesɛtũ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Kakpɛ nwu di Saul leyo batii ku Dawid leyo batii ntɛɛ late kaaklɛ. Dawid nnwɔɔ, aatɔɔwɛ osie, kafɔɔ Saul leyo nni, diatɔɔwa kasɔ.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Babisuɔtɔbi</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Baalofo babisuɔtɔbi baata Dawid di Hebron: Obi nɔɔ kasale niale Amnon, Ahinoam wɔ niakye ni Yesreel obisuɔtɔbi.<verse eid="2SA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Ɔnyɔɔfa, Kileab, wɔ niale ni Abigail, Nabal kpisɔfɔ nwu niakye ni Karmel obisuɔtɔbi;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:3">otiɛfa, Absalom, niale ni Tamai ɔka wɔ niakye ni Gesur obisankobi Maaka obisuɔtɔbi nɛ;<verse eid="2SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />ɔnaafa, Adonigya, Hagit obisuɔtɔbi;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:4">ɔnɔɔnle, Sefatia, Abital obisuɔtɔbi;<verse eid="2SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />okuɔnle, Yitream, Dawid ɔsɔfɔ Egla obisuɔtɔbi.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:5">Mba mmle baalofo baata Dawid di Hebron nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abner Lalaakyakaa Di Dawid Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Di kakpɛ nwu di Saul leyo batii ku Dawid leyo batii ntɛɛ kamɛ yi, Abner latookpee kayilakɔ nɔɔ kamu osie di Saul leyo kamɛ. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Saul lawɛ ɔsɔnɔ onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Rispa, aale ni Aia obisankobi. Ni di Is-Boset lakaalɛ Abner alɛ, “Be oso faatenko teemi ɔsɔnɔ?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abner lanya ɔblɔ nwaa ta ɔlaa wɔ di Is-Boset lakaalɛ nwɔ ni oso, ni di Abner ladiki kanya alɛ, “Weewee disi nle-di Yuda lɛkyɛ? Miɛ dii le mmle lele onukwale lɛta teefɔ Saul leyo ku leyo nɔɔ batii ku basiɛwo nɔɔ. Nin-yɔ fɔ nkpee di Dawid nnɛɛ. Kafɔɔ nunua foolo mi lɛpɔɔ di ɔsanko wɔ mmle ɔlaa suoto! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Yaa ananfi Abner kootoko, bia ata diwɛ osie nwaa, nse nimbla lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ni Dawid ntɔɔ <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />nin-yɔ Saul leyo sɛka kalekɔ nwu n-yɔ nse Dawid lɛkakpomii di Israel ku Yuda suoto, diɛyɔ ni di Dan diɛlaadu ni Beerseba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Nioso Is-Boset ditasinfuo kanya ɔbɛ ɔtɔkɔ Abner ɔlaa bamba kuonwii, diekye aatɔɔyɛkɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ninfɛ di Abner lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ di leyooto nɔɔ kanya alɛ balaatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Owe kasɔ kale? Nii kanya ku ami, ni kamakyakaako fɔ ninkpaa Israel omuu nwako fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Dilɛ, kamanii kanya ku afɔ. Kafɔɔ komiɛ lɛsaa ninwii nkyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ: Tanwa anu nii, diediki fɛɛkpaa Saul obisankobi Mikal fɛɛwako, nse fɔɔwa famanyɛɛ.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ di Saul obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset ɔkyɛ alɛ balaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yɔ ɔsɔfɔ nii Mikal fatɛɛ. Nnwɔ layɔ Filisti batii kɔlafa sisuɔtɔ apoo lata ni disi asaa ami omu.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Nioso Is-Boset ladiki kanya, ni aata baakpaa ɔsanko nwu di ɔsa nɔɔ, Lais obisuɔtɔbi Paltiel ɔkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Kafɔɔ ɔsa nɔɔ nwu latikanko ɔsɔfɔ sɛɛmaa ku kaku di osuku nwu omuu ɔkyɛ kamɛ baalaadu Baurim. Ninfɛ di Abner latɔkɔ ɔsa nwu alɛ, “Kple fasifi leyo!” Nioso aakple aasifi.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Ni di Abner ku Israel banɔɔfo lakpee asi baawo baabuɛ alɛ, “Di obe owo kamɛ, biamiɛ bilɛ biɔbla Dawid ɔka lee. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Bibla ni nunua! Diekye SAATE nwu laka ntam aata Dawid alɛ, ‘Di kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid suoto kamafe ndiki batii nii Israel di Filisti batii ku balo lɛma bamuu nnɛɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abner kafɔɔ lakakatɛ aata Benyamin batii anu ku anu. Ninfɛ aakyɛ Hebron aalaatɔkɔ Dawid lɛsaa biala le di Israel ku Benyamin leyo nimuu komiɛ alɛ babla ni nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Obe wɔ di Abner wɔ niakyɛ ni ku basuɔtɔ afosi-anyɔ lawa ni Dawid nfũ di Hebron yi, Dawid latũ opunu aatɔɔ ku batii nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Ninfɛ di Abner latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Tɛɛ nsifi wla ninaasiisa Israel omuu nta saate nii ɔka, di mmle baabla ni kanya ninii ku afɔ, alɛ faale sɛka di otu lɛfɔ abiesaa amuu kanya.” Nioso Dawid ladiki Abner osuku, ni aasifi ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoab Lalo Abner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Nfanwu, Dawid bakpɛtɛ ku Yoab laladieko batii baakple baawa ku asaa kpinwu ya baafũ nii. Kafɔɔ Abner ditasinwɛ ku Dawid di Hebron, diekye Dawid ntoodiki nwɔ osuku eesifi. Aasifi kafɔɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Di Yoab ku bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu lababuo ni ku nnwɔɔ, baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner lawa ɔka nfũ, ni di ɔka kafɔɔ ladiki nwɔ osuku, nioso atoosifi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Nioso Yoab lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Be fɛɛbla nɛ? Nyu, Abner lawa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ. Be oso fantɔɔ ansifi? Kanunua atoosifi! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Faye Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner; aawa aabakyɔnkyɔ fɔ, aanyu ofenfe lɛfɔ, aanya lɛsaa biala fɔɔbla nii.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Ninfɛ di Yoab ladie aadiɛ Dawid, ni aakpee batii Abner, baalaakpaa nwɔ di Sira ditubiɔ katũ baawako nɛ. Kafɔɔ Dawid ditatofo nwu ole. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Obe wɔ di Abner lakple aawa ni Hebron, Yoab lakpaa nwɔ aasifiko kayoko ɔlɔɔkɔ, fɛ ɔɔkakatɛko nwɔ di lewofa kamɛ. Di nfa nkpo, alɛ ɔɔbla ankyisa ni di obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Asael ntɔ kanya oso, Yoab latofo Abner kapamii di kafutu, ni aakpi nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Nni sɛmaa, di Dawid lanu ni nle mmle, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Ami ku sɛka kalekɔ nii lele lɛbɛ dinaa ni kaloo di SAATE nwu anu, di Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner ntɔ ɔlaa suoto. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Ntɔ nɔɔ ditika di Yoab ku ote leyo nimuu disi! Yoab leyo ditante alɛ kuonwii nnaa ni di kakɔ ka nikosoo ni ntu ee ɔfiɛ sɛɛle ee otii wɔ ninklee sewoso fiɛ ankyɛ ni ee nnwɔ niekpi ni di kapamii kanya ee nnwɔ di alesaa nnaa ni dieloo diidii.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />(Yoab ku obilɛma Abisai lalo Abner ta aalo ni obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Asael di kakpɛ kamɛ di Gibeon oso.)<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakookaa Abner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Yoab ku batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ alɛ, “Bibɛbɛɛ akpeele lee, biɛyɔ aboko bikpa, biɛlaawi di Abner katũ.” Ɔka Dawid omu latikanko di alakaa nwu sɛmaa. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Ni baalaakookaa Abner di Hebron, ni di ɔka lawi osie kanya di Abner ɔkya suoto nɛ. Batii nwu bamuu kafɔɔ lawi.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Ɔka lasa okunu wɔ mmle aata Abner:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Dikaatɛ Abner kakpi fɛ mmle di otii wɔ ninanle ni kufiofa nkpi ni?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Batanii fɔ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">batakpee sɛkpɛnkyɛ di nkpaa lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Faanɔɔ fɛ mmle di otii nnɔɔ ni di batii kpile anu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Ni di batii nwu bamuu lakple baawi nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Ninfɛ di bamuu lɛma baawa babaatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, ale lesaa lewo di kale diiloo ni; kafɔɔ Dawid laka ntam aabuɛ alɛ, “Yaa ananfi mi kootoko, ata ni bia diwɛ osie nwaa, nse letu bloblo ee lɛsaa bamba lewo fiɛ di kufĩ lɛmɛɛ!”<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Batii nwu bamuu lanya baatɛ nsũ, diabuo ma anu; nwaako, lɛsaa biala di ɔka labla ni labuo ma anu. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Nioso dii nwu nkpo batii nwu bamuu ku Israel omuu latofo alɛ ɔka kɔnɛɛ diesi di Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner olo kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bieye bilɛ otii finle ku otii kplɛ niɛnɔɔ di Israel miɛ wɔ mmle? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Ni miɛ, kuntɛ ami ninle ɔka wɔ bɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ, nnaa osie, kafɔɔ Seruia babisuɔtɔbi ba mmle lesii mi osie. SAATE nwu ata kpileblatɛ nwu koto di sikpile nɔɔ kanya!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Baalo Is-Boset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Obe wɔ di Saul obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset lanu alɛ Abner ntookpi ni di Hebron, nnɛɛ lafee nwɔ, Israel omuu latũkũ. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Saul obisuɔtɔbi nwu lawɛ basuɔtɔ banyɔ ba niale ni batunletɛ di mba nindieko ni batii akudi kanya. Onwii leyooto niale Baana, ɔnyɔɔfa niale Rekab; Beerot otii, Rimon, Beerot otii nwu niakye ni Benyamin kɔna babisuɔtɔbi baale-baabu Beerot fɛ Benyamin lɛba lewo, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />diekye Beerot batii latoso baasifi Gitaim baalaasiɛ ninfa fɛ bafɔɔ diabadu dii le baakpana ni kukũ ko mmle.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />(Saul obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan lawɛ obisuɔtɔbi onwii niafefee ni di nkpaa nɔɔ nwu nnyɔ. Alɛɛ anɔɔ aafũ fiɛ di Saul ku Yonatan ɔlaa lakye Yesreel kuawa. Ni di nyuntɛ nɔɔ layɔ nwɔ aatosoko, kafɔɔ di ɔsanko nwu latɔɔpɛ sɛwa alɛ oosifi nii, obisɔ nwu lakpa, ni aakple lɛbafa nɛ. Obisɔ nwu leyooto niale Mefiboset nɛ.)<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Ninfɛ di Rimon, Beerot otii nwu babisuɔtɔbi Rekab ku Baana ladie alɛ bɔɔkyɛ Is-Boset leyo nɛ. Baalaabuo nfa kakũ kplamantãa, di obe wɔ aatɔɔtɛ ni kakũ nɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Baabuo leyo nwu kaamɛ fɛ akpaa awo bookusii, ni baatofo nwɔ kapamii kaafutu nɛ. Ninfɛ di Rekab ku obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Baana lamaa buɛɛ baasifi nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Baakyɛ leyo nwu di obe wɔ aate ni di atensaa suoto di leten-yo nɔɔ kamɛ. Baatofo nwɔ kapamii baalo ni kamaa, baabudi nwɔ disi. Baayɔ ni baaklee baakyɛ di Araba osuku kakyɛ nwu kamuu. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Ni baayɔ Is-Boset disi nwu baawako Dawid di Hebron, ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya lo lɛfɔ Saul, nnwɔ niamiɛ alɛ oolo fɔ ni obisuɔtɔbi Is-Boset disi. Miɛ SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla eekyisa di saate nii ɔka Saul ku banantii nɔɔ suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Rimon, Beerot otii nwu babisuɔtɔbi, Rekab ku obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Baana alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niadiki mi aakyeko ni dibuo nimuu kamɛ, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />obe wɔ di otii onwii latɔkɔ mi ni alɛ, ‘Saul ntookpi nii,’ aanyu alɛ ɔlaa biene ɔɔwako mi nii, lamufũ nwɔ lalo di Siklag. Nni niale letota le latɔɔ ni di ɔlaa nɔɔ nwu suoto nɛ! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Ni lɛ nfɛ mɔ-nse batii kpile lelo otii tinini di leyo nɔɔ nimu kamɛ di atensaa nɔɔ amu suoto-ni naakaalɛ ntɔ nɔɔ di nnɛɛ lee, nindiki ye kaasɔ ka mmle suoto!”<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Nioso Dawid ladiki bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ kanya, ni baalo ma nɛ. Baabudi nnɛɛ ku nkpaa lɛma, baayɔ atiki lɛma baasaka di lɛpanta ninwii ɔlɔɔkɔ di Hebron. Kafɔɔ baayɔ Is-Boset disi nwu baakookaa di Abner ɔkya kamɛ di Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Labale Israel Ku Yuda Ɔka</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 11.1-9; <ref loc="2SA 14:1-7">14.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Ninfɛ di Israel ana nwu amuu lawa Dawid nfũ di Hebron baababuɛ alɛ, “Suoto sina ku ntɔ lɛfɔ mmu bule. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Saa yi, di Saul lale ni ɔka di suoto loo, afɔ niale nnwɔ nialeko ni Israel katũ di bakpɛtɛ lɛma nkpɛ kamɛ. Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ fɔ alɛ, ‘Afɔ nimaleko batii nii Israel katũ, ni afɔ nikɔwa sɛka ɔbale di suoto lɛma.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Obe wɔ di Israel banɔɔfo bamuu lawa ni Ɔka Dawid nfũ di Hebron, ni di ɔka labla kanya ninii ku mma di Hebron di SAATE nwu anu, ni baapɛ Dawid ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Dawid lafũ alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ fiɛ aabale ɔka, aale sɛka kafɔɔ alɛɛ afosi-ana. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Di Hebron, aale sɛka di Yuda suoto alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ku awɛntɛ akuɔ. Di Yerusalem kafɔɔ, aale sɛka di Israel omuu ku Yuda suoto alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-atiɛ.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Ni di ɔka Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lakyɛ Yerusalem alɛ bɔɔlaakpɛko Yebusi batii ba niasiɛ ni ninfa nɛ. Ni di Yebusi batii nwu latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Flɔbadu nfũ; bia banumbiɛtɛ ku abafa nimatososa ye.” Baanyu alɛ, “Dawid dilɔbafuo nfa ɔwa.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Kafɔɔ Dawid lafũ Sion kawofakɔ nwu, Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Dii nwu nkpo, Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Olele nielenkee Yebusi batii kamafe di ntu lɛkɛ̀ ankyɛ mba ninle ni ‘abafa ku banumbiɛtɛ’ ba ninle ni Dawid balo nfũ.” Nkpo oso mambuɛ alɛ, “ ‘Banumbiɛtɛ ku abafa’ dilɔbabuo lɛka-yo nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lalaasiɛ di ayo nwu di kawofakɔ nwu kamɛ, ni aalɛɛ ka alɛ Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nɛ. Ni aase oyoyiɛ letofo okyisa nwu, aakyeko kamɛ seyoyiɛ lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Ni di Dawid latɔɔwɛ osie aatɔɔkyakaa nɛ, diekye SAATE, Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni lasiɛko nwɔ.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Ninfɛ di Tiro ɔka Hiram lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ ku sewoso se manlɛɛ ni sida ku asaa-bawolatɛ ku afuɔ ayo-batofotɛ baawa Dawid nfũ baabatofo lɛka-yo baata Dawid nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ni di Dawid latofo alɛ SAATE nwu ntoose nwɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel suoto, ɛɛtakatɛsa kafɔɔ sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ katoo ta Israel, batii nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Di Dawid ladie ni di Hebron sɛmaa, aawɛ basɔnɔ ku basɔfɔ kpinwu di Yerusalem. Ni baalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi kpinwu baatɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Nnya babi ba baalofo baatɔɔ ni di Yerusalem ayooto: Samua, Sobab, Natan, Solomon, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Yibhar, Elisua, Nefet, Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elisama, Eliada ku Elifelet.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lalenkee Filisti Batii</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 14.8-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Di Filisti batii lanu alɛ batɔɔpɛ ni Dawid ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel suoto, ni baakata ku osie omuu baakyɛ baalaawolaa nwɔ nɛ. Kafɔɔ Dawid lanu nwu ole, ni aasoo aasifi kawofakɔ nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii lawa baabasisiɛ baakyaka Refiam Ɔtaata nwu nɛ; <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />nioso Dawid lawolaa kamɛ aakyeko SAATE nwu nfũ alɛ, “Nkyɛ ninaakpɛko Filisti batii? Fabayɔ ma fankpee mi ninnɛɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Ni di SAATE nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kyɛ, diekye nwaako kamayɔ Filisti batii nwu nkpee fɔ ninnɛɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Nioso Dawid lakyɛ Baal Perasim aalalenkee ma ninfa. Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Fɛ mmle di ntu ntaa nindie nii, nkpo di SAATE nwu ntoodieko balo nii di anu nii nɛ.” Nioso baalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Baal Perasim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baal Perasim lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, saate wɔ nimbɛ andie nii</char></note> nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Filisti batii ladiɛ afiɔ lɛma ninfa, ni di Dawid ku batii nɔɔ latuka nya baasifiko nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Filisti batii lakple baakata baawa baabasisiɛ baakyaka Refaim Ɔtaata nwu; <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />nioso Dawid lawolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ, ni aatuna nwɔ alɛ, “Tankata tinini faakyɛ, kafɔɔ fe ma sɛɛmaa, faakpɛko ma di awoso ya manlɛɛ ni balsam sitũ. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Nse feenu-onu kɔfɛɛfɔ sɛlɔ di balsam awoso nsintɛɛ, faadie wla, diekye nni nimatuo alɛ SAATE nwu ntoole fɔ katũ ɔɔkpɛ Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ nɛ.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Nioso Dawid labla fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ nii. Ni aalo Filisti batii aatɛtɛɛ di osuku omuu, diayɔ ni di Gibeon dialaadu ni Geser.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu Baawako Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 13.1-14; 15.25-16.6, 43)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Dawid lakple aasiisa Israel bakpɛtɛ ba bamuu aadiki nii, bamuu labla nkpe afosi-atiɛ. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Nnwɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ladie di Baala Yuda alɛ bɔɔlaayɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu ninfa manwako. Nni Leyooto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leyooto le mmle ninle YAWEH nɛ, leyooto nwu di Israel batii ninlɛɛ ni nɛ</char></note> manlɛɛ alɛ, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni leyooto, oole ni sɛka di kerubim wɔ nintika ni di alakaa nwu osi obo. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Ni baayɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu baatika di keke fɔle suoto, baakyeko Abinadab leyo le niatika ni di lekpenkpe osi baawako nɛ. Abinadab babisuɔtɔbi Usa ku Ahio niatɔɔkpa keke fɔle nwu <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />di Yaa lɛlakaa nwu latika ni di osi. Ahio lale ni katũ. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Dawid ku Israel leyo nimuu latɔɔnya suoto lɛyɔɔ ku osie lɛma omuu di SAATE nwu anu ku sinu ku bakyitaa, basanku, akasa, abi ku abombo.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Baabadu ni Nakon kakpaa, ni di Usa lamufũ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu nɛ, diekye banankyue nwu latuntula. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔblɔ lasoo di Usa suoto, ta lɛsaatambu nɔɔ oso; nioso Yaa lapɛ nwɔ aayu, ni akpi aate ninfa di Yaa lɛlakaa nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lanya ɔblɔ ta SAATE nwu ɔblɔ wɔ aanya ni di Usa suoto oso. Nioso diɛbadu miɛ wɔ mmle bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Peres Usa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peres Usa lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, SAATE nwu ɔblɔ lasoo di Usa suoto</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Dii nwu nkpo Dawid layɛkɛ SAATE nwu, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Lɛ nfɛ di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa kamawa ɔkyɛ nii?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Atatootuna alɛ ɔɔyɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ansifiko Dawid Okpoo Kplɛ nwu. Nioso aafenko ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ aalaase di Obed-Edom, Git otii nwu leyo. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />SAATE nwu lɛlakaa laka di Obed-Edom, Git otii nwu leyo awɛntɛ atiɛ, ni di SAATE nwu latɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ nnwɔɔ ku leyo nɔɔ batii bamuu nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Ɔka Dawid alɛ, “SAATE nwu ntɔɔta lɛtɔtrɔ Obed-Edom leyo batii ku lɛsaa biala le ninkpe nwɔ nii, ta Yaa lɛlakaa nwu oso.” Nioso Dawid lasoo aakyɛ aalaayɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu di Obed-Edom leyo aakatako aawako Dawid Okpoo Kplɛ nwu ku suoto lɛyɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Obe wɔ di mba niatuka ni SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ladiki ni akpakyɛlɛ akuɔ, ni di Dawid layɔ nankyue-suɔtɔ ku lɛnankyuebi le ninsi ni lɛla aata oleɔta nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Dawid lakpee simu akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ aatootũ di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa anu ku osie nɔɔ omuu, <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />di obe wɔ di nnwɔɔ ku Israel leyo nimuu lawako ni SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ku kudú ku akyukyoo sɛlɔ.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa latoobuo ni Dawid Okpoo Kplɛ nwu, Saul obisankobi Mikal latoonyu di sɛfle. Ni aanya mmle di Ɔka Dawid kotũ, anyeyefe ni di SAATE nwu anu yi, Mikal lanyu nwɔ nyakatãa di otu nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Ni baayɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa baawako baabase di kayilakɔ nini di lɛkpaayo le di Dawid lapɛ aata nini kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di Dawid lata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta oleɔta di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Obe wɔ aaloo ni ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta, ni aawii batii nwu lɛtɔtrɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni leyooto kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Ninfɛ aata otii biala di Israel batii dikudi nimuu kamɛ, basuɔtɔ ku basanko akyuu lɛma anyɔ, obiala bloblo dikudi, sina dikudi ku nta lewosobi kosole nɛ. Ni di batii nwu bamuu lasifi ayo lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Obe wɔ di Dawid lasifi ni leyo alɛ ɔɔlaawii ni leyo nɔɔ batii lɛtɔtrɔ yi, Saul obisankobi Mikal ladie aabakyakako nwɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lɛ di Israel ɔka lekpee suoto ɔmɛnɛfɛ miɛ nkpo, eediki lɛkyɔtɔ di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ balanle-sankobi anu fɛ mmle di ditiipɛ mbla ni!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Mikal alɛ, “SAATE nwu anu diale, nnwɔ niadiki mi ni, atadiki ni teefɔ ee otii lele di leyo nɔɔ kamɛ, di obe wɔ aase mi ni sɛka di SAATE nwu Israel batii suoto-kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Kamabla bia atiipɛsaa nlenkee nle mmle, mankpee mi sinunsɔ di anu nii amu. Kafɔɔ di balanle-sankobi ba mmle ɔlaa feebuɛ nii, babatɛɛ dibu.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Nioso Saul obisankobi Mikal ditawɛ babi dialaadu dii le aakpi nii.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Natan Ɔkakatɛ Ɔta Dawid</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 17.1-15)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Obe wɔ di ɔka nwu nfɛ nsi ni di lɛka-yo nɔɔ, di SAATE nwu ntɔɔtɔɔ ɔɔtɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ di balo nɔɔ bamuu niamana nwɔ baakyi ni suoto yi, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />ni aatɔkɔ Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ Natan alɛ, “Nyu, ami nsi di sida sewoso lɛka-yo kamɛ, kafɔɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu lɛka di lɛkpaayo kamɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Ni di Natan latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Lɛsaa lele ninsi fɔ diisi, nwini faabla ni, diekye SAATE nwu nsiko fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Kafɔɔ kakyɛ nwu, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa Natan nfũ kuabuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="2SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Kyɛ faalaatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni: Feenyu falɛ afɔ nimatofo leyo fantɛɛ nsiɛ ni kaamɛ? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Diayɔ ni di dii le lakpaa Israel batii ladieko ni di Egipte diabadu ni dii le baakpana ni kukũ ko mmle, ami ninnsiɛ di leyo kamɛ. Nkyɛ kokyi aba aba ku lɛkpaayo fɛ kasiɛkɔ nii. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Kakɔ lele ledie lɛkyɛ ku Israel batii bamuu, dii lewo latɔkɔ ɔka lɛma owo wɔ latɔkɔ nlɛ anyu ni batii nii Israel nlɛ, “Be oso fanaantofo sida leyo fatɛɛ?” ’ <verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Nioso nunua, tɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni: Ami niakpaa fɔ lakyeko bafoso ɔkpa ku sɛfa kaweekɔ nlɛ bale sɛka di batii nii Israel suoto. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Ntoosiɛko fɔ di kakɔ lele fɛɛkyɛ, ntootososa kafɔɔ balo lɛfɔ bamuu di anu lɛfɔ. Kanunua kamata leyooto lɛfɔ mmuɔ, fɛle batii kplɛ ba ayooto kaasɔ suoto. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Kamata kafɔɔ batii nii Israel lɛba. Kamatɛ ma alɛ baawɛ kafa lɛma kamu alɛ balaasinkpee ma ni kubuɛ. Amumu batii dilɔbasinnyinka ma diidii, fɛ mmle baabla ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />ntoodibla ni kafɔɔ bia obe wɔ lase ni batunletɛ di batii nii Israel suoto. Kamata fɔ kafɔɔ fantɛ ɔnyɛɛ di balo lɛfɔ bamuu nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘SAATE nwu kɔtɔkɔ fɔ alɛ, SAATE nwu omu kamatɛ sɛka ole nta leyo lɛfɔ: <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Nse ayi lɛfɔ ntooloo, nfɛ fɔɔtɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate lɛfɔ yi, kamata kafutu lɛfɔ obi an-yila fɔ kaanya. Nnwɔ nimakye ni ntɔ lɛfɔ mmu kamɛ, kamatɛ kafɔɔ sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Nnwɔɔ ninle nnwɔ nimatofo leyo anta ni Leyooto nii nɛ, kamase kafɔɔ sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ lekpomii dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Kamale nwɔ kote, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ abale mi obisuɔtɔbi. Nse ɛɛbla okpile, kamayɔ batii mpɛ nwɔ fɛ letoko nanfi ku lɛpɛ le okle mampɛ ni batii. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Kafɔɔ lɛbɔmbɔ nii dilɔbadie di suoto nɔɔ diidii, fɛ mmle ladiki nini di Saul suoto, nnwɔ lakyisa ni di anu lɛfɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Leyo lɛfɔ ku sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ kamate dinaa ni kaloo di anu nii; babase lekpomii lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nioso Natan latɔkɔ Dawid sɛlaa nwu simuu di odiki otuo omuu wɔ mmle kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 17.16-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Di obe owo kamaa, Ɔka Dawid labuo lɛkpaayo le aapɛ aata ni Yaa lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ, aalaasiɛ di SAATE nwu anu, ni aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“Oo SAATE Kplɛ, owe nle, obe kafɔɔ di leyo nii batii nle, alɛ fatɔɔkpaa mi fɛɛbadunko nfũ mmle? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Oo SAATE Kplɛ, ta nle mmle diɛpɔ ni di anu lɛfɔ oso, fatɔɔkakatɛ kafɔɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ leyo di dii kaamaa suoto. Oo SAATE Kplɛ, nkpo kanya fambla fanta batii obe lele nɛ?<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />“Oo SAATE Kplɛ, obe nfɛ di Dawid kabuɛ antɔkɔ fɔ ankyakaa? Diekye faye kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Ta ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu ku nle fɛɛtɛ ni ɔbla kanya oso, fatɔɔbla lɛsaa kplɛ le mmle, fɛɛta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ letofo ni.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />“Oo SAATE Kplɛ, nyu mmle feemuɔ ni! Kuonwii nnaa fɛle afɔ, Yaa kuonwii nnaa kafɔɔ, diediki afɔ, fɛ mmle butoonu ni ku atoko loo amu. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Bawe kafɔɔ ninte fɛle batii lɛfɔ Israel- kale ka kanwii kaasɔ suoto di Yaa ladie aakyɛ aalaadiki ni fɛ batii aata ni suoto nɔɔ. Alɛ oofũ leyooto anta ni suoto nɔɔ, ambla ni asaa kplɛ ku ayɛkɛsaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ, aatososa ni nnle ku afiɔ lɛma aadiki ni di batii lɛfɔ anu, mba faadiki faakyeko ni Egipte? <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Oo SAATE, fatoose batii lɛfɔ Israel fɛ mba niɛtɛ bale ni bale fɔ bamu dinaa ni kaloo, ni di afɔ fatookple Yaa lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“SAATE Yaa, ni kanunua, klee ntam lɛfɔ nwu dinaa ni kaloo. Ɔlaa wɔ faabuɛ faatɛ faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ku leyo nɔɔ kanya. Bla fɛ mmle faabuɛ faatɛ ni, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />alɛ leyooto lɛfɔ kamakpɛ ni, dinaa ni kaloo. Ni batii kamabuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni ninle Yaa di Israel suoto!’ Ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Dawid leyo kamate di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />“Oo SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni, Israel Yaa, fatoodiki nle mmle feetuo kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ feebuɛ falɛ, ‘Kamatɛ sɛka ole nta leyo lɛfɔ.’ Nioso kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntɔɔwɛ sɛkambi, ɔɔpɛ ɔlaa wɔ mmle anta fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Oo SAATE Kplɛ, afɔ ninle Yaa! Sɛlaa lɛfɔ nle disitikasaa, fatɔɔka ntam di asaa biene ya mmle fɛɛta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Nioso nunua, ta dile fɔ dibiesaa, faawii kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ leyo lɛtɔtrɔ, alɛ baakyɛ sitũ di anu lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo. Oo SAATE Kplɛ, diekye afɔ nintɔɔkakatɛ, ku lɛtɔtrɔ lɛfɔ nwu, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ leyo kamawɛ lɛtɔtrɔ dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Nkpɛ Alenkee</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 18.1-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Di obe owo kamaa, Dawid lalenkee Filisti batii, aawakosa ma kasɔ, aafũ Meteg Amma okpoo di Filisti batii nnɛɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Dawid kafɔɔ lalenkee Moab batii. Aata ma baate kaasɔ, ni aaklapoosa ma ku okũ kaanale nɛ. Ekũ lɛkaana sɛnyɔ biala, aalo ma, kafɔɔ aata lɛkaana tiefa lasiɛ nkpa. Nioso Moab batii labasiɛ di Dawid kalɔ, ni baawako nwɔ kɔsɔsĩ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Dawid lakple aakpɛko Soba ɔka Rehob obisuɔtɔbi Hadadeser, di obe wɔ aakyɛ alɛ ɔɔlaakple anse ni kasɔ nɔɔ difũ di Efrate Okle kotoko. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Dawid lafũ bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kakpe, bakeke bawantɛ nkpe nkuɛnsĩ ku bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa nkpe afosi-anyɔ. Dawid labubudi bamuu sɛkpaakũ, diabu bakeke bapɔnkɔ kɔlafa.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Di Siria batii di Damasko lawa baabakyakaako ni Soba ɔka Hadadeser, Dawid lalo batii lɛma nkpe afosi-anyɔ nkpe nnyɔ. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latofo bakpɛtɛ kasiɛkɔ di Siria batii kasɔ suoto di Damasko, ni di Siria batii lasiɛ nwɔ kaalɔ, baatɔɔwako nwɔ kɔsɔsĩ nɛ. SAATE nwu lata Dawid lelenkee di kakɔ lele aakyɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Dawid layɔ koto sɛɛle kubiafunsaa ya niale ni Hadadeser banɔɔfotii ale aawako Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Dawid layɔ abɔɔsaa kpinwu niale ni Hadadeser ale di Beta ku Beroai sekpoo nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Di Hamat ɔka Toi lanu alɛ Dawid ntoolenkee ni Hadadeser bakpɛtɛ bamuu yi, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />ni aakpee obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yoram alɛ alaasɛɛsa Ɔka Dawid, aatansa nwɔ di kakpɛ lelenkee nɔɔ di Hadadeser suoto nɛ, nnwɔ niakpɛko ni Toi. Yoram lakyɛnko Dawid koto fututu, koto sɛɛle ku abɔɔsaa asaa.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Nioso Ɔka Dawid lakleklesa asaa ya mmle aata SAATE nwu, fɛ mmle aabla ni ku koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ko aakyeko ni nnle be mmuu aawakosa ni kasɔ: <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Nsĩ niale Edom ku Moab, Amon batii, Filisti batii ku Amalek nɛ. Aakleklesa kafɔɔ kakpɛ asaa ya aayɔ ni di Soba ɔka Rehob obisuɔtɔbi Hadadeser nfũ.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Ni di Dawid lafũ leyooto di obe wɔ aalaalo ni Edom batii lefosi nkpe nnɛ di Mmba Ɔtaata aakple ni sɛmaa nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Aatofo bakpɛtɛ nsiɛkɔ di Edom aafenko, ni di Edom batii bamuu lasiɛ di Dawid kalɔ nɛ. SAATE nwu lata Dawid lelenkee di kakɔ lele aakyɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Dawid lale sɛka di Israel omuu suoto, aatɔɔbla nle niate ni tinini, di osuku kanya aata batii nɔɔ bamuu. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoab wɔ di ɔya niale ni Seruia niayila di bakpɛtɛ kanya; Ahilud obisuɔtɔbi Yehosafat niale akũ katɛkɔ nyuntɛ; <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi Sadok ku Abiatar obisuɔtɔbi Ahimelek niale olebatatɛ; Seraia niale kukũ kpanatɛ; <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Yoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia niayila di Keret batii ku Pelet batii kanya; Dawid babisuɔtɔbi lale ɔka olebatatɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ku Mefiboset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakaalɛ alɛ, “Otii owo lekple eebu di Saul leyo kamɛ, kabla nwɔ ni sifutulɛ ta Yonatan oso?”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Saul leyo kamɛ kpɛmblatɛ onwii lawɛ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Siba. Ni baalɛɛ nwɔ baawako Dawid anu, ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Afɔ ninle Siba nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Kuonwii diekple abu di Saul leyo, kafuo nwɔ ni Yaa sifutulɛ ɔbla ɔta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ninfɛ di Siba latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Yonatan obisuɔtɔbi onwii lekple eebu; nkpaa nɔɔ nwu nnyɔ lekpi.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ akpe?” Ninfɛ di Siba ladiki kanya alɛ, “Akpe di Amiel obisuɔtɔbi Makir leyo di Lo Debar.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Nioso Ɔka Dawid lata baalaakpaa nwɔ di Amiel obisuɔtɔbi Makir leyo di Lo Debar baawako.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Di Saul obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan obisuɔtɔbi Mefiboset lawa ni Dawid nfũ, aawakasɔ aatɔɔ dibu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Ninfɛ di Dawid lalɛɛ alɛ, “Mefiboset!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tan-yɛkɛ, diekye nwaako kamabla fɔ sifutulɛ, ta teefɔ Yonatan oso. Kamakplesa kasɔ ka kamuu ninle ni ɔwa lɛfɔ Saul kale nta fɔ. Obe lele kafɔɔ fabale alesaa di opunu nii suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Ni di Mefiboset lawakasɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Obe di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle, alɛ faanyu ami wɔ ninte ni fɛle weewee wɔ niekpi ni?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lalɛɛ Saul kpɛmblatɛ Siba aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ntɔɔyɔ lɛsaa biala ninle ni Saul ku leyo nɔɔ batii lele lɛta saate lɛfɔ ɔwa-suɔtɔbi. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Afɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ bikpɛ kasɔ nwu, biɛyɔ alesaa nwu biwako, alɛ baayɔ man-nyu saate lɛfɔ ɔwa-suɔtɔbi nwu. Kafɔɔ saate lɛfɔ ɔwa-suɔtɔbi Mefiboset, kamale alesaa di opunu nii suoto obe lele.” (Di obe nwu kamɛ Siba lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi lefosi-banɔɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ afosi-anyɔ.)<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ninfɛ di Siba latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamabla lɛsaa lele di saate nii ɔka lediki kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ kanya alɛ abla nii.” Nioso Mefiboset lale alesaa di Dawid opunu suoto fɛle ɔka obisuɔtɔbi onwii okle.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefiboset lawɛ obisuɔtɔbi-kosopo onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Mika, ku Siba leyo kamɛ batii bamuu lale Mefiboset bakpɛmblatɛ. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Nioso Mefiboset wɔ di nkpaa nwu nnyɔ lakpi ni lasiɛ di Yerusalem. Diekye obe lele aatoole alesaa di ɔka opunu suoto.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lalenkee Amon Batii Ku Siria Batii</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 19.1-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Di obe owo kamaa, Amon batii ɔka lakpi, ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Hanun layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Kamabla sifutulɛ nta Nahas obisuɔtɔbi Hanun, fɛ mmle di ote labla sifutulɛ aatɛɛ nii.” Nioso Dawid lakpee batii alɛ balaata Hanun yɔɔsa batɔɔ ta ote kukpi nwu oso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Di Dawid batii nwu lawa ni Amon batii kasɔ, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />ni di Amon batii banɔɔfotii labuɛ baatɔkɔ saate lɛma Hanun alɛ, “Feenyu falɛ dibu di Dawid kɔta ni teefɔ oso eekpee batii alɛ babata fɔ yɔɔsa? Diele okpee di Dawid lekpee fɔ batii alɛ babanyunyu okpoo nwu, baala nwu, baabafũ nwu?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Nioso Hanun lata baamufũ batii nwu, baakpaasu osuɔtɔ biala okusu kakyɛ, baabubudi akpeele lɛma di akyeke ntɛɛntɛɛ, ni baadiɛ ma baasifi nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Dawid ɔlaa wɔ mmle, ni aakpee batii alɛ balaakyakako basuɔtɔ nwu, diekye baakpee ma sinunsɔ osie kanya. Baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, ɔka alɛ, “Bisiɛ di Yeriko dilaase di obe wɔ di sikusu lee ntooyie ni fiɛ biekple biwa.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Di Amon batii latofo alɛ nfɛ bookpete ni di Dawid anwunfie kamɛ yi, baalaayɔ Siria batii bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa nkpe afosi-anyɔ di Bet Rehob ku Soba ku Maaka ɔka batii kakpe, ku bakpɛtɛ lefosi nkpe nnyɔ ba niakye ni Tob.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Di Dawid lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle, ni aakpee Yoab ku bakpɛtɛ bamuu nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Ni di Amon batii ladie baabayila di kakpɛ kanya di okpoo kplɛ lɛma kasukunya, Siria batii ba kafɔɔ niakye ni Soba ku Rehob ku bakpɛtɛ ba niakye ni Tob ku Maaka lasiɛ di lepoo kamɛ lete lɛma.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoab lanya alɛ kakpɛ nwu nkpe di sitũ nɔɔ ku sɛmaa nɔɔ; nioso aadiki bakpɛtɛ nwaa bawo di Israel aatɔɔ ma aakpee Siria batii. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Aayɔ bakpɛtɛ bule aakpee di obilɛma Abisai kanyu kalɔ, ni aatɔɔ ma aakpee di Amon batii suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Ni di Yoab labuɛ alɛ, “Nse Siria batii lesii mi osie yi, ni faawa fabafũ mi; kafɔɔ nse Amon batii lesii fɔ osie yi, ni ami kamawa mma fũ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Wɛ osie, faata bukpɛ ku sɛkambi buta batii loo ku Yaa loo sekpoo kplɛ nwu. SAATE nwu kamabla nle ninlɛ ni di anu nɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ninfɛ di Yoab ku bakpɛtɛ ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lataka alɛ bɔɔkpɛko Siria batii, ni baatoso di Yoab anu nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Di Amon batii lanya alɛ Siria batii kotoso nii, mma kafɔɔ baatoso di Abisai anu, ni baasifi okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Nioso Yoab lakple di Amon batii nwu ɔkpɛko, aakple aawa Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Di Siria batii lanya alɛ Israel lalenkee ma ni sɛmaa, baakple baasi dikudi. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Ni di Hadadeser lata baakpaa Siria batii baakyeko Efrate Okle kamaa baawako; ni baasifi Helam, di Hadadeser bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ Sobak laleko ma ni katũ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Dawid ɔlaa wɔ mmle, ni aasiisa Israel omuu, baawaalɛ Yordan baasifi Helam. Ni di Siria batii lataka kakpɛ alɛ bɔɔkyakako Dawid mankpɛko nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Kafɔɔ baatoso di Israel anu, ni di Dawid lalo bakeke lɛma bawantɛ alafa akuɛnsĩ ku bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa nkpe afosi-ana nɛ. Aasafɔ kakpɛ lɛma kanyayilatɛ Sobak kafɔɔ aatɛ, ni aakpi ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Obe wɔ di baka ba bamuu niasiɛ ni di Hadadeser kalɔ lanya alɛ Israel ntoolenkee ma nii, baabla atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ninii ku Israel batii, ni baasiɛ ma kaalɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Nioso Siria batii layɛkɛ alɛ blɔbasinkyakaako Amon batii diidii.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ku Batseba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Di kabienle, obe wɔ di baka nkyɛ ni kakpɛ, Dawid lakpee Yoab ku ɔka batii ku Israel batii bakpɛtɛ bamuu. Baawɔɔsa Amon batii, baafũ kafɔɔ Raba okpoo. Kafɔɔ Dawid lasiɛ di Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Dii ninwii kɔtɔɔfɔ, Dawid lataka di atensaa nɔɔ, ni aakyɛ aatookyi di lɛka-yo lɛkya osi nɛ. Di lɛkya nwu osi, aanya alɛ ɔsanko onwii kokpe ntu. Ɔsanko nwu latɛ aalɛ sekpeele, <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />ni di Dawid lakpee otii alɛ aalaawolaa ɔsanko nwu kamɛ nɛ. Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Batseba dile, Eliam obisankobi, ale ni Heti otii nwu, Uria ɔsɔfɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakpee batii baalaakpaa nwɔ baawako nwɔ nɛ. Ɔsanko nwu lawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, ni di Dawid latenko nwɔ nɛ. (Di ɔsanko nwu laloo ni suoto nɔɔ okleklesa ɔsaabla ɔbla di kɔkpaa nɔɔ ɔpɛ kaasɔ suoto nɛ.) Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lakple aasifi leyo nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Ɔsanko nwu lalaka lɛmɛ, ni aata Dawid kanya alɛ, “Nlaka lɛmɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Nioso Dawid lata Yoab kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Kyesee mi Uria, Heti otii nwu.” Ni di Yoab lakyesee Uria di Dawid nfũ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Di Uria lawa ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, Dawid lakaalɛ nwɔ mmle di Yoab nte nii, mmle di bakpɛtɛ late nii ku mmle di kakpɛ nwu latoofe nii. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Uria alɛ, “Soo fatɔɔkyɛ leyo lɛfɔ faalaafoto nkpaa lɛfɔ.” Nioso Uria ladie di lɛka-yo, nni kamaa, ɔka lakyesee nwɔ lɛkyɛsaa. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Kafɔɔ Uria ditasoo aakyɛ leyo nɔɔ, aate di lɛka-yo nwu kayoko kanya ku saate nɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ bamuu.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Dawid alɛ, “Uria ditakyɛ leyo,” ni aakaalɛ Uria alɛ, “Diele kanunua feekye osuku kyonle fɛɛwa nɛ? Be oso fanankyɛ leyo?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ni di Uria latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Lɛlakaa nwu ku Israel ku Yuda batii nsi di akpaayo kamɛ, saate nii Yoab ku saate nii bakpɛtɛ kafɔɔ lɛbla kasikɔ di apoo kamɛ. Lɛ nfɛ di ami kasifi leyo nii nnaale, nnyi, nnaatenko ɔsɔfɔ nii? Nwaako, fɛɛnya fakpe ni nkpa, namabla lɛsaa le mmle okle!”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kple fasiɛ ninfũ dii ninwii fakyakaa, kɔsɛɛ kamakplesa fɔ nkyesee.” Nioso Uria lasiɛ di Yerusalem dii nwu ku kaleesɛ. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Ta Dawid nialɛɛ nwɔ ni oso, Uria lale, aanyi ku nnwɔɔ, ni di Dawid latɔɔ nta aanyi, aasiɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ kɔtɔɔfɔ nwu Uria ditakyɛ leyo, aasifi aalaate di ɔkla nɔɔ suoto di saate nɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Di olesɛ nwu Dawid lakpana kakunkyɛɛ aata Uria lakyɛnko Yoab. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Dawid lakpana kaamɛ alɛ, “Yɔ Uria fase di nfũ di kakpɛ kanya nkpe ni osie. Biekple nwɔ sɛɛmaa nfɛ, alɛ baasafɔ nwɔ mantɛ, ankpi.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Nioso, di Yoab lata baamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi nii, aayɔ Uria aase di lɛba le aatofo alɛ balo lɛma basientɛ nwaa lawɛ nii. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Obe wɔ di okpoo kplɛ nwu bakpɛtɛ ladie baabakpɛko ni Yoab, basuɔtɔ bawo di Dawid bakpɛtɛ kamɛ lanɔɔ; diɛkyakaa nii, Uria, Heti otii nwu lakpi.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Ninfɛ di Yoab lakyesee Dawid kakpɛ nwu sɛlaa simuu nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoab latɔkɔ batɔkyɛntɛ nwu alɛ: “Nse bitooloo kakpɛ nwu sɛlaa se mmle ɔtɔkɔ ɔka yi, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />loo ɔka nwu ɔblɔ kamataka, ankaalɛ ye alɛ, ‘Be oso biɛtɛ biɛtɛɛtɛɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu bilɛ biɔkpɛ nwu? Bieye bilɛ babataa kɔtaa mankyeko oyoyiɛ nwu? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Owe nialo Yerub-Beset obisuɔtɔbi Abimelek?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mankple manlɛɛ ni Yerub-Baal (ninle ni Gidieon)</char></note> Diele ɔsanko onwii niayu okuɔlɛ di oyoyiɛ nwu suoto aalaasɔɔ, diata aakpi di Tebes? Be oso biɛtɛ biɛtɛɛtɛɛ oyoyiɛ nwu?ʼ Nse ɛɛkaalɛ ye nse mmle yi, bitɔkɔ nwɔ bilɛ, ‘Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Uria, Heti otii nwu kafɔɔ ntookpi.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Tɔkyɛntɛ nwu ladie aalaabuo nii, aatɔkɔ Dawid lɛsaa biala di Yoab lakpee nwɔ alɛ aabuɛ nii. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Tɔkyɛntɛ nwu latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Bakpɛtɛ nwu ladie baabalenkee wo baakpɛko wo di lepoo kamɛ, kafɔɔ buatososa ma buasifiko sɛmaa baalaadu okpoo kplɛ nwu kayoko. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Ninfɛ di kɔtaa bataatɛ lataa bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ di oyoyiɛ nwu suoto, ni di ɔka bakpɛtɛ bawo lakpi nɛ. Diɛkyakaa nii, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Uria, Heti otii nwu ntookpi.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ tɔkyɛntɛ nwu alɛ, “Tɔkɔ Yoab sɛlaa se mmle: ‘Tanta diabuo fɔ suoto; kapamii nlo onwii, kanlo ɔbamba. Nwini fakpɛko okpoo kplɛ nwu faawɔɔsa nwu.ʼ Buɛ nnwɔ mmle fakpee Yoab osie.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Di Uria ɔsɔfɔ lanu alɛ ɔsa ntookpi nii, ni aakusii nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Di okusiibee nwu laloo nii, Dawid lata baakpaa ɔsanko nwu baawako leyo nɔɔ, aabakple Dawid ɔsɔfɔ, ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi aatɔɔ nɛ. Kafɔɔ lɛsaa le di Dawid labla ni ditayɔɔ SAATE nwu kafutu.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natan Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Dawid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu lakpee Natan, Dawid ɔkyɛ nɛ. Aakyɛ ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Basuɔtɔ banyɔ banwii lawɛ di okpoo onwii. Onwii saawɛntɛ, ɔnyɔɔfa kafɔɔ piitɛ. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Saawɛntɛ nwu latɛ aawɛ bafoso ku banankyue sɛlambu kplɛ. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Kafɔɔ piitɛ nwu ditawɛ lɛsalɛsaa, diediki lefosobi-sanko biibii ninwii aaya nii. Aanyu ni disi, diamuɔ ku nnwɔɔ ku babi nɔɔ. Nintoole alesaa nɔɔ, nintoonyi di opũ nɔɔ, bia nintoote di nnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ. Lefosobi nwu late fɛle obisankobi diatɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />“Ninfɛ di ɔfɔɔ onwii labuo saawɛntɛ nwu nɛ, kafɔɔ saawɛntɛ nwu lasĩ nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ foso ee nankyue ɔyɔ ɔwa alesaa ɔta ɔfɔɔ nwu niawa ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. Kafɔɔ, aayɔ lefosobi-sanko le niale ni piitɛ nwu ole aalo, aawa alesaa aata ɔfɔɔ nwu niawa ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Ɔblɔ lafiɛ Dawid di saawɛntɛ nwu suoto, ni aatɔkɔ Natan alɛ, “Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, dikaatɛ alɛ osuɔtɔ wɔ niabla ni nle mmle kakpi! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Dikpe nii anta lefosobi nwu koto di sɛna kanya, ta ɛɛbla ni lɛsaa le mmle, ananya ni nyaami oso.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Ninfɛ di Natan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Afɔ ninle osuɔtɔ nwu nɛ! Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni: ‘Lapɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel suoto, ni ladiki fɔ di Saul nnɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Layɔ saate lɛfɔ leyo lata fɔ, saate lɛfɔ basɔfɔ lekpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. Layɔ Israel ku Yuda leyo lata fɔ. Ni nse n-ya mmle diɛpɔ fɔ mɔ, ntabata fɔ nkyakaa bia. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Be oso feenyu SAATE nwu ɔlaa nyakatãa, fɛɛbla nle ninle ni okpile di anu nɔɔ? Feelo Uria, Heti otii nwu ku kapamii, ni fɛɛyɔ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ fɛɛbla ole fɔ omu. Faalo nwɔ ku Amon batii kapamii. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Nioso, kanunua, kapamii nwu dilɔbadie di leyo lɛfɔ. Diekye faanyu mi nyakatãa, ni faayɔ Uria, Heti otii nwu ɔsɔfɔ faabla ole fɔ omu nɛ.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni: ‘Kamata ɔlaa kpile nkye leyo lɛfɔ nimu kamɛ kunwa di suoto lɛfɔ. Di anu lɛfɔ amuamu kamafũ basɔfɔ lɛfɔ, n-yɔ ma nta otii wɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ fɔ nii, antenko basɔfɔ lɛfɔ nwu di kakũ kplamantãa. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Faabla ni di lewofa kamɛ, kafɔɔ kamabla nle mmle di kakũ kplamantãa di Israel omuu anu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Natan alɛ, “Lɛbla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Ni di Natan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ okpile lɛfɔ nwu ɛɛkyɛ fɔ. Flɔbakpi. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Kafɔɔ ta fɛɛbla ni nle mmle, fatɔɔta SAATE nwu balo konyu nwɔ ni nyakatãa oso yi, obisuɔtɔbi nwu beelofo bɛɛta fɔ ni kamakpi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Obisuɔtɔbi Lakpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Di Natan lasifi ni leyo kamaa, SAATE nwu lapɛ obisɔ wɔ di Uria ɔsɔfɔ lalofo aata ni Dawid, ni aabuo ɔfiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Dawid latikiti Yaa lekoto aata obisɔ nwu. Ni asifi leyo nɔɔ kamɛ, ni aasiɛ nkyɛ nwu, aanii kanya, aatoote kaasɔ. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Leyo nɔɔ kamɛ banɔɔfo layila di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɔɔ alɛ bɔɔtakatɛsɔɔ kaasɔ, kafɔɔ aasĩ, atale alesaa kuanwii kafɔɔ ku mma.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Dii kuɛsinle suoto, obisɔ nwu lakpi. Dawid batɔkyɛntɛ layɛkɛ nwɔ ɔtɔkɔ alɛ obisɔ nwu ntookpi, diekye baanyu alɛ, “Di obe wɔ di obisɔ nwu lawɛ ni nkpa, buakakatɛ buata Dawid, kafɔɔ atanu wo ɔlaa. Lɛ nfɛ bubatɔkɔ nwɔ bulɛ obisɔ nwu ntookpi? Loobia ababla suoto lɛsaa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Dawid lanya alɛ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ kɔkakatɛ sɛwɛɛwɛɛ ninma, ninma, ni aatofo alɛ obisɔ nwu ntookpi nɛ. Ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Obisɔ nwu ntookpi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Ni baatuna alɛ, “Yii, atookpi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lataka kaasɔ nɛ. Aakpee ntu, aafifia nnɔnyi aaloo nii, aakyɛlɛnsa akpeele nɔɔ, ni aasifi SAATE nwu lɛkpaayo aalaasumu nɛ. Ninfɛ aasifi leyo nɔɔ nimu, ni di nnwɔɔ omu aakaalɛ alesaa, baawako nwɔ nya aale nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso fɔɔbla asaa nkpo? Obe wɔ di obisɔ nwu lasiɛ ni nkpa, faanii kanya, faawi kaku. Kafɔɔ nunua di obisɔ nwu ntookpi nii, fatɔɔtaka feele alesaa!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Ni di Dawid ladiki kanya alɛ, “Obe wɔ di obisɔ nwu lasiɛ ni nkpa, lanii kanya, lawi kaku. Lanyu nlɛ, ‘Owe nin-ye? Loobia SAATE nwu kamale mi sibualɛ aanta obisɔ nwu nsiɛ nkpa.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Kafɔɔ nunua atookpi nii, be oso nfɛ kanii kanya? Kamafuo nwɔ nkpa okplesa ɔta? Ami nimakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ ɔlɔbakple awa ɔkyɛ nii.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalofo Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakpee ɔsɔfɔ Batseba kɔnɛɛ kaafutu, ni aakyɛ aalaate di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ nɛ. Ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi, aatɔɔ leyooto alɛ Solomon. SAATE nwu labɔmbɔ obisɔ nwu. <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Ta SAATE nwu labɔmbɔ ni obisɔ nwu oso, aata kanya aafenko di Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ Natan suoto alɛ alaatika obisɔ nwu leyooto alɛ Yedidia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ SAATE nwu labɔmbɔ nwɔ</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lalenkee Raba Okpoo</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro. 20.1-3)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ninfɛ di Yoab lakpɛko Amon batii di Raba, aafũ lɛkayo katanikokɔ nwu. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Ni di Yoab lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ Dawid nfũ alɛ, “Ntɔɔkpɛko Raba lefũ nwu ntu kadukɔ. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Nunua, siisa bakpɛtɛ bule baabamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baafũ nwu. Se diele nkpo, kamayɔ okpoo kplɛ nwu, man-yɔ leyooto nii mantika nwu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Nioso Dawid lasiisa bakpɛtɛ bamuu, ni baakyɛ Raba, baalaakpɛko nwu baafũ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Ni aatekete lɛkakoto nwu di ɔka lɛma disi nɛ- onutũ nini niale koto sɛɛle bakilo afosi-atiɛ bana, baaklɛɛ ni ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya-ni baayɔ baatũkũsa Dawid diisi nɛ. Aayɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kpinwu di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Ni aakpaa batii ba niawɛ ni di okpoo nwu kamɛ, aata ma baatɔɔbɛ sewoso, abɔɔsaa owola, batɔɔbɛ ntɔɔni ku nfɛ, aata ma kafɔɔ baatɔɔpɛ atɛnkudi. Aabla nle mmle di Amon batii sekpoo simuu kamɛ. Ninfɛ di Dawid ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu lakple baasifi Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amnon Ku Obilɛma-Sankobi Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Di obe owo kamaa, Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Absalom obilɛma-sankobi Tamar nialɛ ni sekpeele ɔlaa lasiɛ di Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Amnon otu.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnon laklee akpɔkpɔtɔ diata alɛ aabuo ɔfiɛ, ta obilɛma-sankobi Tamar oso. Diekye kabitɛ aale, ni diate nwɔ fɛ ɔlɔbawɛ Tamar abla nwɔ lɛsalɛsa kuninwii ku nnwɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Kafɔɔ Amnon lawɛ siɛwo onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Yonadab, Dawid obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Simea obisuɔtɔbi aale. Yonadab latɛ aabe anu. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Ni di Yonadab lakaalɛ Amnon alɛ, “Be oso di afɔ ɔka obisuɔtɔbi, fante biɔɔ nkpo olesɛ biala? Flɔɔtɔkɔ mi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Ni di Amnon latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Obiloo Absalom obilɛma-sankobi Tamar ɔlaa nsi mi di otu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Ni di Yonadab latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Laate di atensaa suoto, faakũ fabla fɛ ofiɛ foofiɛ. Nse teefɔ lɛwa fɔ onyu, faatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Komiɛ nlɛ obiloo-sankobi Tamar awa aabatɛɛ lɛsaa lewo nle. Tɔɔ abawa alesaa nwu di anu nii nintoonyu nwɔ, alɛ kale nya di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Nioso Amnon late, ni aakũ aabla fɛ ofiɛ oofiɛ nɛ. Di ɔka lawa nwɔ ni onyu, ni di Amnon latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Komiɛ nlɛ obiloo-sankobi Tamar awa aabafiɛ bloblo nwaa owo di anu nii, alɛ kale nwɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lata Tamar kanya di lɛka-yo alɛ: “Kyɛ obilee-suɔtɔbi Amnon leyo faalaawa alesaa awo fatɔɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Nioso Tamar lakyɛ obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Amnon leyo, aalaanyɔɔ aate nii. Ni aabla mbɔle nwo, aanwɔtɔ aasɛ kaklo kawo di anu nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Ninfɛ aadiki kaklo nwu aatika di bɛɛsi tɛnklɛ aata Amnon nɛ, kafɔɔ aasĩ, atale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Ni di Amnon labuɛ alɛ, “Obiala adie ninfũ. Nioso obiala lasifi aadiɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ninfɛ di Amnon latɔkɔ Tamar alɛ, “Yɔ alesaa nwu fawako ninfũ di leten-yo nii kamɛ alɛ kale nya di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ.” Ni di Tamar layɔ kaklo ka aasɛ ni aakyɛnko obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Amnon di leten-yo nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Kafɔɔ aayɔ aakyɛnko nwɔ alɛ ale nii, aamufũ nwɔ kɔɔnɛɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Obiloo-sankobi, wa nintenko fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Ni di Tamar latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Obiloo-suɔtɔbi, tambla! Tannyinka mi. Diɛkaatɛ bɛɛbla lɛsaa le mmle okle di Israel! Tambla lɛsaa kpile le mmle. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Ni ami mɔ? Ɔfɛ kamatɛ sinunsɔ nii se mmle? Ni afɔ mɔ? Fabate fɛle amumu bablatɛ babuutɛ onwii lɛma di Israel. Lekoto, kakatɛko ɔka; ɔlɔbasĩ alɛ ntan-yɔ fɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Kafɔɔ aasĩ, Amnon ditanu nwɔ ɔlaa, ta aawɛ osie aalenkee ni Tamar oso, aayɔ osie aatenko nwɔ.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Ninfɛ di Amnon lakyidi nwɔ osie kanya nɛ. Nwaako, aakyidi Tamar aalenkee lɛbɔmbɔ le aawɛ aatɔɔ nii. Ni di Amnon latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Taka fadie!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Ninfɛ di Tamar latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Oowo! Otososa nii kamalalaasa ɔlaa kunlenkee nle fatoole katũ fɛɛbla mi nii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Kafɔɔ aasĩ, Amnon ditanu nwɔ ɔlaa. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Ni aalɛɛ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ omu aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Diki ɔsanko wɔ mmle ninfũ, faasɛɛ kokloo di sɛmaa nɔɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Nioso kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ladiki nwɔ aase kaayi, aasɛɛ kokloo di sɛmaa nɔɔ. Tamar lakpee akpeele wua ya niafũ ni kɔya, diekye akleesaa nwu okle di ɔka kokpeelebitɛ nkpee nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Ni di Tamar layɔ ntɔ̀ aakpete di disi nɔɔ, aabɛbɛɛ akpeele wua nɔɔ ya niafũ ni kɔya aakpee nii. Ninfɛ aayɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ aatika di disi nɔɔ aakyɛ aasifi, aatoowi kaku wloloo di obe wɔ aatoosifi nii.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Ni di obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Absalom latɔkɔ Tamar alɛ, “Obilee-suɔtɔbi Amnon lɛkpanko fɔɛ? Obiloo-sankobi, lokanana; obilee-suɔtɔbi ale. Tan-yɔ nle mmle faakpee di otu.” Ni di Tamar lasiɛ di obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Absalom leyo fɛ ɔsanko wɔ beediki ni di batii kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Di Ɔka Dawid lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle omuu, ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Absalom ditatɔkɔ Amnon ɔlaa kuonwii diidii, obiene ee okpile; aakyidi Amnon diekye aakpee obilɛma-sankobi Tamar sinunsɔ.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Absalom Labla Aakyisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Di alɛɛ anyɔ sɛmaa, obe wɔ di Absalom bafoso sinwini banwiɛtɛ lawɛ ni di Baal Hasor, ninkaako ni Efraim kɔmɛ, ni di Absalom lalɛɛ ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu alɛ bawa nfa nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Ni di Absalom lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntɔɔta bafoso sinwini banwiɛtɛ lɛwa. Lekoto, ɔka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ kamawɛ wo kaamɛ?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Oowo, obisuɔtɔbi nii. Bamuu loo dilɔbakyɛ; atoo bubale munta fɔ.” Nu di Absalom lanyinka nwɔ, aasĩ ɔkyɛ, kafɔɔ aawii nwɔ lɛtɔtrɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Ninfɛ di Absalom labuɛ alɛ, “Lekoto, nse flɔɔwa, ni ta obiloo-suɔtɔbi Amnon akyɛ ku awo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Lɛ oso kanya aakyɛ ku aye?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Kafɔɔ Absalom lanyinka ɔka, nioso aata Amnon ku ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bule lakyɛ ku nnwɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Ni di Absalom latɔkɔ batii nɔɔ alɛ, “Binu! Nse Amnon ntoonyi nta oosiɛ osie kanya yi, lɛtɔkɔ ye nlɛ, ‘Bisafɔ Amnon bitɛ,’ ni bielo nwɔ. Bitan-yɛkɛ. Ami niediki ye kanya. Biwɛ osie ku sɛkambi.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Nioso Absalom batii labla Amnon lɛsaa le di Absalom ladiki ma ni kanya alɛ babla nii. Ninfɛ di ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu lataka baasiɛ di babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo baatoso baasifi nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Obe wɔ bakyɛ ni di osuku, kanya ntoodu Dawid alɛ: “Absalom ntoolo ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu ɛɛtɛ; kuonwii lɛma diebu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Ni di ɔka lataka aayila, aabɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ, aaklɛ aate kaasɔ; ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ labɛbɛɛ akpeele lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Kafɔɔ Dawid obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Simea obisuɔtɔbi Yonadab labuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii atannyu alɛ beelo ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu; Amnon lete niekpi. Nle mmle niale lɛsaa le di Absalom latɛ ni, bia dii le di Amnon layɔ osie aatenko ni obilɛma-sankobi Tamar nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Saate nii ɔka atan-yɔ nwu ole di ɔlaa nwu suoto alɛ ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu nintookpi nii. Amnon lete niekpi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Di obe nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ, Absalom ntootoso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Ni di osuɔtɔ wɔ nin-yɛ oonyu ni lanyu katoo nɛ, ni aanya batii kpinwu di osuku di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ nɔɔ lɛkyɛ, boososoo di lekpenkpe nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ manwa. Ni di asaa-nyuntɛ nwu lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Lɛnya batii di Horonaim lɛkyɛ, di lekpenkpe nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Ninfɛ di Yonadab latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Nyu, ɔka babisuɔtɔbi nwu ntɔɔwa; ditɔɔwa fɛ mmle di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ labuɛ ni obuɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Aaloo oloo ɔkakatɛ, ɔka babisuɔtɔbi nwu niawa bababuo, baatoowi kaku osie kanya. Ɔka kafɔɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu latɛ baawi nwaa.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Absalom latoso aasifi Gesur ɔka, Amihud obisuɔtɔbi Talmai ɔkyɛ. Kafɔɔ Ɔka Dawid lawi obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ dii biala.<verse eid="2SA 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Di Absalom latoso aasifi ni Gesur, aasiɛ ninfa alɛɛ atiɛ. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Kafɔɔ ɔka lamiɛ alɛ ɔɔkyɛ Absalom nfũ, diekye otu nɔɔ ntoote di Amnon kukpi nwu suoto.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yoab Lamiɛ Osuku Aata Absalom Okple Ɔwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab latofo alɛ ɔka otu ntika alɛ ɔɔnya Absalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Nioso Yoab lakpee otii aakyɛ Tekoa aalaakpaa ɔsanko wɔ niebe ni anu aawako nfa. Ni aatɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Kũ fabla fɛ kaku fasi. Klee kaku asaa, tamblako nnɔnyi kunwii ɔkpɛ. Bla fɛle ɔsanko wɔ ninsi ni kaku di ayi kpinwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Faakyɛ ɔka nfũ nfɛ faalaakanka sɛlaa se mmle fatɔɔ.” Ni di Yoab layɔ sɛlaa nwu akpee nwɔ kaanya nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Di ɔsanko wɔ niakye ni Tekoa lakyɛ ni ɔka nfũ, aawakasɔ aase katũ kaasɔ aatɔɔ dibu, aabuɛ alɛ, “Oo ɔka, kyakaakoe!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe nikokpee fɔ kubuɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako kpisɔfɔ nle; ɔsa nii ntookpi. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nkpe babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ. Baatɔɔkpɛko bawo di kofe, kuonwii ditawɛ ninfa aakpanaa ma nii. Onwii lasafɔ owo nɔɔ ni aakpi nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Nunua kafaabi kamuu ntɔɔtaka di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ suoto; boobuɛ alɛ, ‘Diki nnwɔ niasafɔ ni obilɛma-suɔtɔbi fata, di mmle bualo nwɔ ni ta obilɛma-suɔtɔbi wɔ aalo ni oso; nse batoodiki otii wɔ nimale ni atesaa kafɔɔ nɛ.’ Babaniisa lɛtɔkɔnii le lete niebu nii. Man-yɛɛsa ɔsa nii leyooto ee banantii nɔɔ kaasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ leyo, kamata kufiofa di disi lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Kafɔɔ ɔsanko wɔ niakye ni Tekoa latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Ɔka saate nii, ta lɛpɔɔ okpi nwu ditika di ami ku teemi leyo batii suoto, di ɔlaa kuonwii kutantika di ɔka ku lɛka-kpomii nɔɔ suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nse otii owo lebuɛ ɔlaa lele ɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ yi, kpaa nwɔ fawakoe, ni ɔlɔbasinkple aakpee fɔ kubuɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ni ɔka aka di SAATE, Yaa nɔɔ suoto, atĩi otii wɔ nimbla ankyisa ni osuku alɛ atambla akyisa, di mmle manamawɔɔsa ni obisuɔtɔbi nii nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ disi onwini onwii bia dilɔbakpa kupɛ kaasɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ abuɛ ɔlaa onwii atɔkɔ saate nii ɔka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Kakatɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Be oso nfɛ di afɔ fɛɛbla lɛsaa fɛle nle mmle okle di Yaa batii suoto? Nse ɔka lebuɛ nnwɔ mmle, diele suoto nɔɔ oolo lɛpɔɔ nɛ, ta ɔka diikplesa obisuɔtɔ nɔɔ wɔ beetososa ni awako ni oso? <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Fɛle mmle di ntu nnwii ni kaasɔ, manasinfuo ni ɔlɛ, nkpo dikpeni buokpi nɛ. Kafɔɔ Yaa nindiki otii nkpa; kafɔɔ, anwɛ sisuku ambla mmle di otii wɔ beetososa ni dilaablasa ni suoto di nnwɔɔ Yaa suoto.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />“Nunua ntɔɔwa nwɔ mmle obuɛ ɔtɔkɔ saate nii ɔka, diekye batii nwu lɛtɛɛ lɛyɛkɛ. Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lenyu alɛ, ‘Kamakakatɛ nta ɔka; loo bia ababla nle di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lɛkaalɛ nii. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Loo bia ɔka kamatuna andiki kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ankyeko osuɔtɔ wɔ nikomiɛ alɛ alo ni ami ku obiisuɔtɔbi nii, banyɔ loo adiki ni di atesaa ya di Yaa lɛta wo ni suoto.’<verse eid="2SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />“Nioso kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Saate nii ɔka ɔlaa nwu kutɛɛ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ, diekye saate nii ɔka nte fɛle Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ, antofo ni dibiene ku dikpile. SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ asiɛko fɔ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Tansĩ kanya odiki di ɔlaa wɔ kamakaalɛ fɔ ni suoto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ta saate nii ɔka akakatɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Diele Yoab kɔnɛɛ ninsiko fɔ di nle mmle nimuu kamɛ nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako, di saate nii ɔka lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, kuonwii dilaafuo omunikĩi ofe koletanɛɛkyɛ ee kɔmɛntunɛɛkyɛ di ɔlaa lele di saate nii ɔka lebuɛ ni suoto. Nwaako, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yoab niatɔkɔ mi alɛ mbla nle mmle, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ niɛyɔ sɛlaa se mmle simuu eekpee di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yoab lɛbla nle mmle alɛ ɔɔyɔ amunikĩisa nunua letɛmbi le mmle. Saate nii nkpe lɛsaatofo fɛle Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ-aye lɛsaa biala ninwa ni di kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Kulɛ nwaa, kamabla nkpo. Tɔɔkyɛ faalaakpaa okosopo Absalom nwu fawako.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Ni di Yoab lawakasɔ, aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ aata ɔka dibu, aawii nwɔ lɛtɔtrɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ di Yoab labuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii ɔka, miɛ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntootofo alɛ atɔɔwɛ sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ, diekye ɔka ntootuna ɛɛta di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ɔlaa suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ninfɛ di Yoab lakyɛ Gesur aalaakpaa Absalom aakplesa aawako Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Kafɔɔ ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Atɔɔkyɛ leyo nɔɔ nimu; atannya anu nii.” Nioso Absalom lasifi leyo nɔɔ nimu, atanya ɔka anu.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Di Israel omuu, osuɔtɔ kuonwii ditawɛ aalɛ ni sekosopo, baatansa nwɔ ni osie kanya manlenkee ni Absalom okle. Diayɔ ni di nsintɛɛ nɔɔ diabadu ni nkpaasɔ nɔɔ, ole kuonwii ditawɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Obe obe aatoonwiɛ disi nɔɔ- nse ditoosii nwɔ onutũ ɔwɛ- onutũ nini nwo bakilo banyɔ ku lɛsaa di lɛklaposaa osuku kanya.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Babisuɔtɔbi batiɛ ku obisankobi onwii baalofo baata Absalom. Obisankobi nwu leyooto niale Tamar, aabale ɔsanko wɔ nialɛ ni sekpeele.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Absalom lasiɛ di Yerusalem alɛɛ anyɔ, atanya ni ɔka anu. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ninfɛ di Absalom lakpee alɛ balɛɛ Yoab batɔɔ, aakpee nwɔ aakyɛ ɔka nfũ. Kafɔɔ Yoab lasĩ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ɔwa. Nioso aakpee lɛnyɔɔfa, kafɔɔ aasĩ ɔwa. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ninfɛ di Absalom latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Binyu, Yoab kofe ninle kɔnyɔɔfa di kole mi nɛ, akpaa nɔɔ kafɔɔ n-yɛ ninfa. Bikyɛ biɛlaakpee nya ɔtɔ.” Nioso Absalom bakpɛmblatɛ lakpee Yoab kofe nwu ɔtɔ.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Ninfɛ di Yoab lakyɛ Absalom leyo aalaakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lekpee kofe nii ɔtɔ?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Ni di Absalom latɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Nyu, lata fɔ kanya labuɛ nlɛ, ‘Wa ninfũ alɛ kakpee fɔ faanaakaalɛ ɔka falɛ, “Be oso lekye Gesur lɛwa? Ditabalɛ mi ninlenkee nse fɛ nkpe ninfa!” ’ Nunua nfɛ komiɛ nlɛ kɔnya ɔka anu, ni nse lekpi lɛpɔɔ di lɛsaa lele suoto, faatɔɔ alo mi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Nioso Yoab lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ɔka ɔlaa wɔ mmle. Ninfɛ di ɔka lalɛɛ Absalom, ni aawa aabawakasɔ, aase katũ kaasɔ di ɔka anu. Ni di ɔka lafĩfiɔ Absalom akpoo nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Absalom Labla Disibu Di Ɔtaka Oyila Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, Absalom lamiɛ keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ ku bakpɛtɛ afosi-anɔɔ babale nwɔ ni katũ. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Antaka kolɛsɛtũ annaayila di osuku-lɔɔkɔ nikofe ni okpoo kplɛ nwu kayoko. Obe lele di otii owo lɛwako ɔlaa alɛ ɔɔbaka antika ɔka andiki kɔkpaa yi, Absalom nlɛɛ nwɔ ankaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔmɛn-kpoo feekye?” Otii nwu mbuɛ alɛ, "Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lekye kɔna kunwii kamɛ di Israel.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Nse Absalom ntɔɔtɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nyu, sɛlaa lɛfɔ lɛkpa kamɛ, kafɔɔ ɔka ɔnɔɔfotii kuonwii nnaa abanuko fɔ nii.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Nse Absalom ntoobuɛ ɛɛkyakaa alɛ, “Nse fɛle manse mi kantɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto! Nse otii biala ninkpe ɔlaa ee ɔlaa letũ nwɔ kawa ɔkyɛ nii, ni ma nyu nlɛ ɛɛwɛ lɛka tinini.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Otii lele kafɔɔ niɛwa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ ɔɔwakasɔ di anu nɔɔ, Absalom ndiki kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ amufũ nwɔ anfĩfiɔ nwɔ akpoo. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Absalom lafe di osuku wɔ mmle suoto aabla Israel batii bamuu ba niawa ni ɔka nfũ alɛ aka lɛka tinini ata ma nii, nioso aafũ Israel batii situ.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Di alɛɛ ana kayɛntɛkɔ, Absalom latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Tɛɛ nkyɛ Hebron ninaabla di ntam kanya ka laka lata ni SAATE nwu. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Obe wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lasiɛ ni di Gesur di Aram, laka ntam be mmle nlɛ: ‘Nse SAATE nwu lekplesa mi eesifiko Yerusalem, kamasumu SAATE nwu di Hebron.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.” Nioso aasifi Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Ninfɛ di Absalom lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ di lewofa kamɛ di Israel ana nwu amuu aafenko alɛ, “Se bienu onu dikyukyue sɛlɔ biebuɛ bilɛ, ‘Absalom ninle ɔka di Hebron.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Basuɔtɔ alafa anyɔ niakye Yerusalem baatikanko Absalom. Baalɛɛ ma fɛ mba bɛɛkyakako nii, ni baakyɛ batatofo nwu ni ole kuonwii, di ɔlaa nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Obe wɔ di Absalom latɔɔta ni oleɔta, aakpee kafɔɔ alɛ balɛɛ Ahitofel, Gilo otii nwu, nnwɔ ninka ni Dawid, baakyeko okpoo nɔɔ Gilo. Nioso kanwumbe okũ nwu lawɛ osie, Absalom batikankotɛ kafɔɔ latɔɔpɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Latoso Aadie Di Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Ni di tɔkyɛntɛ onwii labatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Israel batii situ nfɛ ntika di Absalom suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ba niawɛ ni di Yerusalem ku nnwɔɔ alɛ, “Biwa! Dikpe ni buotoso, se diele nkpo kuonwii loo dilɔbadie di Absalom nnɛɛ. Dikpe ni buodie kanunua, se diele nkpo abawa wla amalenkee wo, anlo wo, anwɔɔsa okpoo kplɛ nwu ku kapamii.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Ni di ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lelolaa suoto alɛ bababla lele di saate loo ɔka lenyu alɛ dilɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Nioso ɔka ladie ku leyo nɔɔ batii bamuu baatikanko nwɔ; kafɔɔ aadiɛ basɔnɔ nɔɔ lefosi aatɛ alɛ batoonyu lɛka-yo nwu. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Nioso ɔka ladie, di batii nwu bamuu latikanko nwɔ nii, ni baalaayila di lɛba ninwii fanfã nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Basuɔtɔ nɔɔ bamuu lakyɛ baafe nwɔ, manko Keret batii ku Pelet batii bamuu; ku Gat batii alafa akuɔ ba bamuu niatikanko nwɔ baakye ni Gat, lakyɛ baafe di ɔka anu.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Itai, Gat otii nwu alɛ, “Be oso fakyɛ ku awo? Kple fasifi faalaasiɛ ku Ɔka Absalom. Ɔfɔɔ fale, otii wɔ beediki ni di okpoo nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Kɔsa lete faawa. Ni mmiɛ nta fɔ fakyɛ fatookyi ku awo, ninan-ye nfũ kofe ni? Kple fatɔɔkyɛ, faalaakpaa kale lɛfɔ batii fasifiko. Sifutulɛ ku onukwale ole asiɛko fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Kafɔɔ Itai latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, di saate nii ɔka lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, kakɔ lele di saate nii ɔka kamawɛ, kuntɛ kukpi ee nkpa, nfa di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamawɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Itai alɛ, “Nwini, bafe sitũ.” Nioso Itai, Gat otii nwu lafe ku batii nɔɔ ku leyo nɔɔ batii ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Ni di kale nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ batii bamuu lawi osie kanya di batii nwu bamuu latoofe ni nɛ. Ɔka kafɔɔ lawaalɛ Kidron Ɔtaata nwu, ni di batii nwu bamuu lafe baasifi baakyɔɔ ɔfaafuu nwu anu nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Sadok kafɔɔ lawɛ ninfa, Lewi batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ latuka Yaa kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu. Baasoosa Yaa lɛlakaa nwu baase, ni di Abiatar lata oleɔta dialaase di obe wɔ di batii nwu bamuu laloo ni odie di okpoo kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Sadok alɛ, “Kplesa Yaa lɛlakaa nwu fasifiko okpoo kplɛ nwu. Nse mawɛ sibualɛ di SAATE nwu anu, ni abakplesa mi anwako, antɛɛ nkple nnya ni ku kasiɛko nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Kafɔɔ nse eebuɛ alɛ, ‘Floobuo mi anu,’ ni letuna; tɔɔ abla mi lele eenyu alɛ dilɛ ditɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Ɔka kafɔɔ latɔkɔ oletatɛ Sadok alɛ, “Diele otii wɔ ninnya ni asaa fale? Kple fasifi okpoo kplɛ nwu di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, ku obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Ahimaas ku Abiatar obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan. Afɔ ku Abiatar bikpaa babisuɔtɔbi lee banyɔ nwu biklee. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Kamasoko ye di okle kawaalɛkɔ nwu di ɔfaafuu, ninaase di obe wɔ di kanya makye ɔkyɛ lee kamatɛɛ ni letofo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Nioso Sadok ku Abiatar lakplesa Yaa lɛlakaa nwu baasifiko Yerusalem baalaasiɛ ninfa.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Kafɔɔ Dawid lakple aatɔɔkata Nnɔnyi Awoso Kobokote nwu, ɔɔkata nii, oowi; aatĩi disi nɔɔ, aakyɛ nkpaa fukuti. Batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ latĩi asi lɛma, baatoowi, baatɔɔkata nii. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Ahitofel nsi di Absalom kanwumbe bakuntɛ kamɛ.” Nioso Dawid lapɛ ɔlaa aata alɛ, “Oo SAATE, munikĩisa Ahitofel kɔkà nwu fabla dibuu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Di Dawid ladu ni kobokote nwu nsintɛɛ, nfũ di batii nsumu ni Yaa, Husai, Ark otii nwu lawɛ ninfa abakyakako nwɔ nii. Akpeele nɔɔ wua labɛbɛɛ, kudu kafɔɔ latika diisi nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nse fɛɛkyɛ ku ami, fabale atoo fantɛɛ. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Kafɔɔ nse feekple feesifi okpoo kplɛ nwu faalaatɔkɔ Absalom falɛ, ‘Oo ɔka, kamale kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ; teefɔ kpɛmblatɛ lale saa, kafɔɔ kanuna kamale fɔ kpɛmblatɛ,’ ni fabafuo mi ɔkyakaako nkpɔkpɔtɔsa Ahitofel kɔkà. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Olebatatɛ Sadok ku Abiatar kamawɛ ninfa ku afɔ. Tɔkɔ ma lɛsaa lele feenu ni di lɛka-yo. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Babisuɔtɔbi lɛma nwu banyɔ, Ahinaas ku Sadok ku Abiatar obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan nkpe ninfa ku mma. Yɔ ma fakyesee mi ku ɔlaa lele feenu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Nioso Dawid siɛwo Husai lalaabuo Yerusalem di obe wɔ di Absalom latoobuo ni okpoo kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ku Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Obe wɔ di Dawid lakyɛ ni kɛɛkɛ aawaalɛ ni kobokote nwu nsintɛɛ, ni aanya Mefiboset kpɛmblatɛ Siba n-yɛ asoko abakyakako nwɔ nɛ. Aaklee babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ɔlambu, aatukasa ma bloblo akudi alafa-anyɔ, nta awosobi kosole kɔlafa, abue abi ya bɛɛpɛ ni aboo kɔlafa ku nta dikuuku.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ Siba alɛ, “Be oso fɛɛwako asaa ya mmle?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba ladiki kanya alɛ, “Babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo nle ɔka leyo batii bale baatoosiɛ nii, bloblo ku awosobi nwu nle bakpɛtɛ nwu ale baale nii, nta kafɔɔ kakpee mba ditoobuo ni di ɔfaafuu nwu osie.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ di saate lɛfɔ ɔwa-suɔtɔ nwu nkpe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ni di Siba latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Asi di Yerusalem, diekye oonyu alɛ, ‘Miɛ Israel leyo nwu kamakplesa ɔwa nii sɛka kalekɔ mantɛɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Siba alɛ, “Asaa ya amuu ninle ni Mefiboset ale nfɛ nle fɔ ale kanunua.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ni di Siba labuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii ɔka, lɛwakosa suoto kasɔ, tɛɛ nwɛ sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid ku Simei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Di Ɔka Dawid labuo ni Baurim okpoo, osuɔtɔ onwii niakye ni kafaabi kanwii kamɛ ku Saul ladie aakye nfa. Leyooto nɔɔ niale Simei nɛ, Gera obisuɔtɔbi aale, obe wɔ oodie anwa nii, aatɔɔkpaani. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Aafuki afuɔ aakpee Dawid ku ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu, nu di bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu ku banyutɛ finle nwu lawɛ di Dawid koletanɛɛkyɛ ku kɔmɛntukyɛ. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Di Simei lakpaani ni nii yi, aabuɛ alɛ, “Kyɛ ninfa, kyɛ ninfa, afɔ ntɔ-wiitɛ, afɔ ditiipɛ! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />SAATE nwu ntɔɔta fɔ koto di ntɔ be mmuu feewii ni di Saul leyo kamɛ, nnwɔ kasiɛkɔ feele ni sɛka. SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ eekpee di obi lɛfɔ Absalom nnɛɛ. Fatɔɔwa kalookɔ lɛfɔ, diekye osuɔtɔ wɔ niewii ni ntɔ kaasɔ fale!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Ninfɛ di Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Abisai latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Be oso di weewee wɔ mmle niekpi ni kakpaani saate nii ɔka? Tɛɛ nkyɛ ninaabudi nwɔ disi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Kafɔɔ ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa di ami ku aye Seruia babisuɔtɔbi mumbla munta baawo? Nse ɔɔkpaani ta SAATE nwu lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, ‘Kpaani Dawid’ owe ninkafuo ɔkaalɛ alɛ, ‘Be oso fɛɛbla nle mmle?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Abisai ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii, ninle ni ntɔ nii mmu, komiɛ alɛ alo mi. Fiɛnfɛ, di, Benyamin otii wɔ mmle nfɛ! Diɛ nwɔ; tɔɔ akpaani, diekye SAATE nwu niɛtɔkɔ nwɔ nkpo. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Loobia SAATE nwu kamanya nimiina nii antɛɛ koto ku dibiene ta lɛkpaani le kofũ ni miɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Nioso Dawid ku batii nɔɔ layefe osuku, Simei kafɔɔ latɔɔkyɛ di lekpenkpe nwu di Dawid kakyɛ ka nyɔɔfa. Aakyɛ oosifi nii, aatɔɔkpaani Dawid, anfuki afuɔ ankpee nwɔ, ansa nwɔ kafɔɔ kɔtɛ. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Ɔka ku batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lalaabuo kasiɛkɔ lɛma ku dibuo. Nfa baatɛ ɔnyɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Absalom Lakyɛ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Absalom ku batii bamuu di Israel lawa Yerusalem, Ahitofel kafɔɔ lawɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Ninfɛ di Dawid siɛwo, Husai ninle ni Ark otii nwu lakyɛ Absalom nfũ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔka asiɛ nkpa aklɛ! Ɔka asiɛ nkpa aklɛ!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Ni di Absalom lakaalɛ Husai alɛ, “Lɛbɔmbɔ ninle nle mmle footuo ni siɛwo lɛfɔ nɛ? Be oso fanankyɛ ku siɛwo lɛfɔ?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Ni di Husai latɔkɔ Absalom alɛ, “Oowo, nnwɔ di SAATE nwu, ku batii ba mmle ku Israel batii bamuu lediki nii- ole nwɔ kamale, ɔkyɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamaka nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Diɛkyakaa nii, owe ninsumu? Diele obi nwu kasumu? Fɛ mmle lasumu ni teefɔ, nkpo kamasumu fɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Ninfɛ di Absalom latɔkɔ Ahitofel alɛ, “Ta wo disibu lɛfɔ. Be dikaatɛ buɔbla?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ni di Ahitofel latɔkɔ Absalom alɛ, “Tenko teefɔ basɔnɔ ba aadiɛ aatɛ alɛ batoonyu ni lɛkayo nwu. Ni di Israel omuu kamatofo alɛ nfɛ fookpete di teefɔ anwunfie nɛ, ni obiala kafɔɔ nintikanko fɔ ni nnɛɛ kamawɛ osie.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Nioso baapɛ lɛkpaayo baata Absalom di lɛkya osi, ni aatenko ote basɔnɔ nwu di Israel omuu anu nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, disibu le di Ahitofel nta ni late fɛle nnwɔ ninkaalɛ ni Yaa annu nii okle. Nkpo kanya di Dawid ku Absalom, banyɔ lɛma nwu layɔ Ahitofel kɔkà nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Husai Lakyɔnkyɔ Absalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ninfɛ di Ahitofel latɔkɔ Absalom alɛ, “Kamadiki basuɔtɔ lefosi nkpe nnyɔ mandie manaati Dawid kakyɛ ka mmle. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Kamakpɛko nwɔ di obe wɔ ditoobuo nwɔ, nnɛɛ kafɔɔ ntoofee nwɔ nii. Kamata lɛyɛkɛ mpɛ nwɔ, ni batii ba bamuu di suoto nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamatoso. Ɔka lete kamalo <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />ninkplesa batii nwu bamuu nwako fɔ. Osuɔtɔ wɔ kukpi foomiɛ ni kamata bamuu nkple manwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ; blɔbabla batii nwu bamuu lɛsalɛsaa.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Kɔkpaa ko mmle didiki kamalɛ ninta Absalom ku Israel banɔɔfo bamuu.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Kafɔɔ Absalom labuɛ alɛ, “Bilɛɛ Husai, Ark otii nwu kafɔɔ aawa buonu ɔlaa wɔ ninkpe nwɔ ababuɛ ni.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Di Husai lawa ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, Absalom latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ahitofel ntɔɔta wo disibu le mmle. Bubla di nle eebuɛ ni? Nse oowo, ni ta wo disibu lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Ni di Husai latɔkɔ Absalom alɛ, “Nunua disibu le di Ahitofel lɛta ni diɛlɛ. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Faye teefɔ ku batii nɔɔ; bakpɛtɛ bale, bɛɛyakayaka fɛ beetũ wɔ dibi bɛɛyɔ nii. Diɛkyakaa nii, teefɔ kpɛtɛ nwaa ale; ɔlɔbate ku bakpɛtɛ nwu kakyɛ ka mmle. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Bia nunua, atoowofa di ofuɔntuu kamɛ ee lɛba bamba lewo. Nse ɛɛkasa bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ odieko yi, otii lele nienu nwu ole kamabuɛ alɛ, ‘Beeloloo bakpɛtɛ ba nintikanko ni Absalom.’  <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Ni bia kpɛtɛ wɔ ninkpe ni sɛkambi alenke ni, nnwɔ otu ninte ni fɛle kyata otu kamatũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ. Diekye Israel omuu n-ye alɛ teefɔ nle kpɛtɛ, mba di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ nkpe sɛkambi.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />“Nioso kɔka fɔ nlɛ: Ta Israel omuu, diɛyɔ ni di Dan diɛlaadu ni Beeseba-di lɛpɔ lɛma fɛ lekpo ɔtɛnsia-babasi di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, di afɔ omu faleko ma katũ di kakpɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Nse butoodieko nwɔ di kakɔ lele buɔnyɔɔ, nse butoodie buokpete nwɔ di suoto fɛ mmle di oblokyi nkpete ni kaasɔ. Nnwɔɔ ee otii nɔɔ kuonwii dilɔbabu asiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Nse eekple eesifi okpoo owo kamɛ, ni Israel batii bamuu kamawako sikũ di okpoo kplɛ nwu mamananfi nwu mankpete di ɔtaata nwu ninaase di obe wɔ manamasinnya ni kakyɛɛ ninwu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Ni di Absalom ku Israel batii bamuu labuɛ alɛ, “Husai, Ark otii nwu disibu nlɛ dilenke Ahitofel lele.” Diekye SAATE nwu ntɔɔtɛ alɛ ɔɔkpɔkpɔtɔɔsa Ahitofel disibu biene nwu alɛ ɔɔyɔ nimiina anwako di Absalom suoto.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Ni di Husai latɔkɔ olebatatɛ Sadok ku Abiatar alɛ, “Ahitofel lɛka Absalom ku Israel banɔɔfo alɛ babla mmle ku mmle, kafɔɔ ami lɛka ma nlɛ babla nle ku nle. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Nunua ta Dawid kanya wla, baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, ‘Tante di kawaalɛkɔ nwu di ɔfaafuu; taalɛ wla, tankyɛkyɛlɛ, nse diele nkpo babamɛ ɔka ku batii ba bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonatan ku Ahimaas lasiɛ di En Rogel. Ɔsankobi kpɛmblatɛ onwii nikakyɛ anaata ma letofo, nse mma kafɔɔ batɔɔlatɔkɔ Ɔka Dawid. Diekye blɔbakpee suoto kubuɛ alɛ banya ma boobuo ni okpoo kplɛ nwu. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Kafɔɔ okosopo onwii lanya ma, ni aatɔkɔ Absalom nɛ. Nioso banyɔ lɛma nwu lakyɛ wla baasifi osuɔtɔ onwii leyo di Behurim. Osuɔtɔ nwu lawɛ ntu dibiɔ ninwii di kaflɔnkɔ nɔɔ, ni di basuɔtɔ nwu lakata baasoo baabuo kaamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Osuɔtɔ nwu ɔsɔfɔ layɔ ditĩisaa aafukuti aatĩi ntu dibiɔ nwu kanya, aalakasa atitabi ninni suoto. Kuonwii ditatofo nwu ole ninnwu suoto.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Di Absalom batii lawa ni ɔsanko nwu nfũ leeyo, baakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya Ahimaas ku Yonatan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Ni di ɔsanko nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bɛɛwaalɛ okle nwu beesifi.” Batii nwu lawowola ma, kafɔɔ batanya kuonwii, nioso baakple baasifi Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Di batii nwu lasifi baaloo nii, ni di basuɔtɔ nwu banyɔ lakata baadie di ntu dibiɔ nwu, ni baalaatɔkɔ Ɔka Dawid nɛ. Baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Die faawaalɛ okle wla; diekye Ahitofel lɛta ma disibu alɛ mmle ku mmle di suoto lɛfɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Nioso Dawid ku batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ladie baawaalɛ Yordan. Fiɛ di kale lasɛ nii, kuonwii ditabu atawaalɛ ni Yordan okle.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Obe wɔ di Ahitofel lanya alɛ batatikanko ni kɔkà nɔɔ yi, ni aayɔ disiɛsaa nɔɔ aatika di bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, aadie aasifi leyo nɔɔ di okpoo nɔɔ nɛ. Aalolaa leyo nɔɔ kamɛ sɛlaa aatɛ nii, ninfɛ aasaka suoto nɔɔ nɛ. Nioso aakpi, ni baakookaa nwɔ di ote ɔkya kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Dawid lasifi Mahanaim, ni di Absalom lawaalɛ Yordan okle ku Israel batii bamuu nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Absalom layɔ Amasa aase di bakpɛtɛ kanya di Yoab kayilakɔ. Amasa lale osuɔtɔ wɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Yitra, aale Israel otii obisuɔtɔbi aayɔ ni ɔsanko wɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Abigail, Nahas obisankobi, ku Seruia obilɛma-sankobi wɔ niale ni Yoab ɔya. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Israel batii ku Absalom labla kasiɛkɔ di Gilead kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Di Dawid lawa ni Mahanaim, Nahas obisuɔtɔbi Sobi wɔ niakye ni Amon batii Raba, ku Amiel obisuɔtɔbi Makir wɔ niakye ni Lo Debar ku Gilead otii nwu Barsilai wɔ niakye ni Rogelim <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />layɔ atensaa ku abɛɛsibii ku abukii asaa nwu baawako. Baayɔ kafɔɔ anaatĩ, akpaa, nnaafũ ku atitabi sɛnle, ayii ku aketeku, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />bablɔ ku nankyue nnyɛɛntu kpɛnkpɛ ku bafoso ku nankyue nnyɛɛtu nnɔnyi baawako Dawid ku batii nɔɔ baale. Diekye baabuɛ alɛ, “Ditoobuo batii nwu, kɔka ku otukɔnsɔ kafɔɔ ntooklee ma di ɔfaafuu nwu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Baalenkee Absalom Baalo Nwɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lasiisa batii ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ, ni aase ma kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ di nkpe, ku alafa kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Ni di Dawid ladiki bakpɛtɛ nwu osuku di akyuu atiɛ nɛ-ninwii di kanyayilatɛ Yoab kalɔ, ninwii di Yoab obilɛma Abisai, Seruia obisuɔtɔbi kalɔ, ninwii kafɔɔ di Itai, Gat otii nwu kalɔ. Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ bakpɛtɛ nwu alɛ, “Nwaako ami omu kamakyɛ ku aye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Kafɔɔ batii nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Dinaa alɛ feedie; nse diemiina alɛ buatoso, blɔbayɔ nwu ole di suoto loo. Bia kuntɛ kakyɛ loo niekpi, blɔbayɔ nwu ole; kafɔɔ feefũ kɔya falenke nkpe lefosi loo. Dibalɛ alɛ fɛɛta wo lɛkyakaako nunua feekyeko okpoo kplɛ nwu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kamabla lelele ninlɛ dita ye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Nioso ɔka layila di kayoko ɔlɔɔkɔ di obe wɔ di bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu ladie baafe ni di akudi, di alafa ku nkpe kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Ni di ɔka nwu ladiki Yoab, Abisai ku Itai kanya alɛ, “Bitɛ suoto ku okosopo Absalom nwu, ta ami oso.” Bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu lanu ɔka kanya ka ɔɔta ni kanyabayilatɛ biala di Absalom suoto.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu ladie baafe lepoo alɛ bɔɔlaakpɛko Israel, ni baakpɛ kakpɛ nwu di Efraim lepoo kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Nfa di Dawid batii lalenkee Israel bakpɛtɛ nɛ. Batii ba baalo ni dii nwu lapɔ- basuɔtɔ nkpe afosi-anyɔ. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Kakpɛ nwu lakyaka kale nwu kamuu, lepoo nwu kafɔɔ lawɔɔsa batii kpinwu nkpa di dii nwu dialenkee kapamii bale.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Ni diawa alɛ Absalom lakyakako Dawid batii nɛ. Aasiɛ di pɔnkɔ nɔɔ suoto, aatoofe di kowoso kplɛ kunwii sewosola kplɛ kalɔ, ni di kowoso nwu lamufũ Absalom di disi nɛ. Kuamufũ nwɔ kuasakasa di kɔfɛɛfɔ, di obe wɔ di pɔnkɔ nɔɔ wɔ aasiɛ ni kɔkyɛ ni ɔkyɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Di Dawid kpɛtɛ onwii lanya ni nle mmle yi, ni aatɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Kanunua nwu lɛnya Absalom nsaka di kowoso kplɛ kunwii suoto nɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Ni di Yoab latɔkɔ osuɔtɔ wɔ niatɔkɔ nwɔ ni nnwɔ mmle alɛ, “Beeye! Fɛɛnyɔɔ? Be oso fanaasafɔ nwɔ fatɛ kaasɔ ninfa? Nse ntabata fɔ koto fututu lefosi ku ofiamɛ wɔ di bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ntika nii.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Kafɔɔ osuɔtɔ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bia kuntɛ bakilo kakpe bɛɛkadi beekpee di kɔnɛɛ nii yi, namadiki kɔnɛɛ nii nkpanko ɔka obi. Di atoko loo di ɔka ladiki afɔ ku Abisai ku Itai kanya alɛ, ‘Bitɛ suoto ku okosopo Absalom ta ami oso.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Ni nse ami lɛyɔ nkpa nii lekpee di ɔlaa- manan-yɔ lɛsaalɛsaa bakookaa ɔka- afɔ fabablasa suoto lɛfɔ di suoto nii.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Ni di Yoab labuɛ alɛ, “Namasoko fɛle mmle nta fɔ.” Nioso Yoab layɔ akplɔ atiɛ kɔɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aalaatofo Absalom otu, di obe wɔ akpe ni nkpa aasaka ni di kowoso kplɛ nwu suoto. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Ni di Yoab akpɛsaa-bakleetɛ lefosi lamana Absalom baakyi, baasafɔ nwɔ baalo nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Ninfɛ di Yoab lafɛ kakyukyoe, ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu ladiɛ Israel otikanko nɛ, diekye Yoab layilasa ma. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Ni baayɔ Absalom, baafuki baakpee di dibiɔ kplɛ ninwii di lepoo nwu kamɛ, ni baasiisa afuɔ kplɛ baatika di suoto nɔɔ nɛ. Di obe nwu kamɛ Israel bakpɛtɛ ba bamuu niatikanko ni Absalom latoso baasifi ayo lɛma.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Obe wɔ di Absalom lasiɛ ni nkpa, aayɔ difuɔ ninwii aase di lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Ɔka Ɔtaata fɛ ninyumafuɔ aata suoto nɔɔ. Diekye aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnaa obisuɔtɔbi kuonwii abaklee ni leyooto nii man-yɔ manyuma mi nii.” Aayɔ leyooto nɔɔ nimu aatika difuɔ nwu, ni bɔɔlɛɛ ni Absalom Ninyumafuɔ diabadu obe wɔ baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baatɔkɔ Dawid Absalom Kukpi Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Ninfɛ di Sadok obisuɔtɔbi Ahimaas labuɛ alɛ, “Bitɛɛ ntoso nin-yɔ kanya nkyɛnko ɔka nlɛ SAATE nwu ntoodiki nwɔ di balo nɔɔ nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Ni di Yoab latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Diele afɔ nimayɔ kanya fankyɛnko miɛ. Fabakyɛnko kanya nwu obe bamba, kafɔɔ tambla nkpo miɛ, diekye ɔka obisuɔtɔbi niekpi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ninfɛ di Yoab latɔkɔ Kus otii onwii alɛ, “Kyɛ faalaatɔkɔ ɔka nle fɛɛnya ni.” Ni di Kus otii nwu lawakasɔ di Yoab anu, ni aatoso aasifi nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ni di Sadok obisuɔtɔbi Ahimaas lakple aatɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Olele nimawa kuɔwa, lekoto, tɛɛ ntoso ntikanko Kus otii nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Kafɔɔ Yoab ladiki kanya alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii, be oso foomiɛ falɛ fakyɛ? Fanaa ɔlaa kuonwii nimata fɔ ni letota.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ni di Ahimaas labuɛ alɛ, “Olele nimawa kuɔwa, komiɛ nlɛ ntoso nkyɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Nioso Yoab labuɛ alɛ, “Toso fakyɛ ɛ!” Ninfɛ di Ahimaas latoso aafe di ɔtaata osuku aalaafe Kus otii nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Obe nwu Dawid lasiɛ ni di kayoko ka kaamɛ ku kayi kale obo, asaa nyuntɛ kafɔɔ lakata aafe di kayoko oyoyiɛ osuku aasifi lɛkya osi. Aatoonyu nii, aanya osuɔtɔ onwii kotoso anwa lete nɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Ni di asaa nyuntɛ nwu lalɛɛ ɔka aatɔkɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Ninfɛ di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Nse lete nɔɔ dile, ni ɔlaa biene akle.” Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu latɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ, ɔtɛɛtɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Ninfɛ di asaa nyuntɛ nwu lanya osuɔtɔ bamba kotoso anwa, ni aalɛɛ kayoko nyuntɛ alɛ, “Nyu, osuɔtɔ bamba kotoso anwa lete nɔɔ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Ɔlaa biene ɔɔwako nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Ni di asaa nyuntɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Dite mi fɛ osuɔtɔ kasale kotoso fɛle Sadok obisuɔtɔbi Ahimaas.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Otii biene ale, ɔlaa biene ɔɔwako.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ninfɛ di Ahimaas lafaa aatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kule!” Aawakasɔ di ɔka anu, aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Baatansa SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ! Atɔɔyɔ batii ba niatakatɛsa ni nnɛɛ lɛma di saate nii ɔka suoto eekpee fɔ ninnɛɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Okosopo nwu Absalom nkpe nkpa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ni di Ahimaas ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lanya kakpɔkpɔtɔ kplɛ di obe wɔ di Yoab lamiɛ alɛ ookpee ni ɔka kpɛmblatɛ ku ami, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kɔtɔ, kafɔɔ nin-ye obe diale.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yila di ɔlɔɔkɔ fasoko mi ninfũ.” Nioso aabla aalaayila di ɔlɔɔkɔ ninfa.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Ninfɛ di Kus otii nwu lababuo, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii ɔka, nu ɔlaa biene nwu! SAATE nwu ntoodiki fɔ miɛ eekyeko mba bamuu niataka fɔ ni di suoto.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ Kus otii nwu alɛ, “Okosopo nwu, Absalom nkpe nkpa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Ni di Kus otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Saate nii ɔka balo ku mba bamuu niɛtaka alɛ bɔɔbla fɔ ni lɛsaa, bate fɛle okosopo nwu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Ɔlaa nwu latũkunsa ɔka. Ni aakata aasifi leyo le di kayoko osuku kamɛ aalaawi nɛ. Oofe nii, aabuɛ alɛ: “Awo obisuɔtɔbi nii Absalom! Obisuɔtɔbi nii, obisuɔtɔbi nii Absalom! Nse fɛ ami ninkpi, diisi lɛfɔ- Awo Absalom, obisuɔtɔbi nii, obisuɔtɔbi nii!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yoab Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Dawid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Baatɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Ɔka kowi ku sɛnyaami anta Absalom.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Nioso dii nwu nkpo lelenkee lakple kaku kaata bakpɛtɛ bamuu, diekye bakpɛtɛ nwu lanu baabuɛ di dii nwu nkpo alɛ, “Ɔka kowi anta obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Dii nwu nkpo basuɔtɔ nwu lamaa baabuo okpoo kplɛ nwu fɛ mmle di batii ba di sinunsɔ nkpɛ ni nse beetoso di kakpɛ kamɛ mmaa mambuo nii. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Ɔka latĩi anu nɔɔ aawi osie kanya alɛ, “Awo obisuɔtɔbi nii Absalom! Awo Absalom, obisuɔtɔbi nii, obisuɔtɔbi nii!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Ninfɛ di Yoab labuo leyo aalaatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Miɛ fɛɛta sinunsɔ lɛkpɛ bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ bamuu ba niefũ fɔ ni nkpa ku babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi, basɔfɔ ku basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nkpa. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Fambɔmbɔ mba niekyidi fɔ nii, feekyidi kafɔɔ mba nimbɔmbɔ fɔ nii. Fatoodiki feetuo klekle miɛ falɛ bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma diele lɛsalɛsaa bata fɔ. Lɛnya nlɛ ditabayɔɔ fɔ kafutu nse fɛ Absalom nkpe nkpa miɛ di bamuu loo munkpi. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Die fafe kanunua faalaakpee bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ osie. Lɛka di SAATE nwu nlɛ, nse faadie fakyɛ, ni kpɛtɛ kuonwii dilɔbabu di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ kakyɛ ka mmle. Nle mmle kamapa-mbi difuɔ ninlenkee anyasaa ya nitoodiwa fɔ ni di suoto diayɔ ni di sekosopo lɛfɔ obe diɛbadu ni nunua.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Nioso ɔka lataka aasiɛ di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di kayoko osuku nwu. Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni bakpɛtɛ nwu alɛ, “Ɔka nfɛ nsi di kayoko osuku,” ni di bamuu lɛma baawa anu nɔɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2SA 19:8">Dawid Lakple Aasifi Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Obe nwu kamɛ Israel batii latoso baasifi ayo lɛma. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Di ana nwu kamɛ di Israel, batii nwu bamuu latɔɔlɔ ku owo nɔɔ mambuɛ alɛ, “Ɔka ladiki wo di balo loo nnɛɛ; nnwɔɔ ninle otii wɔ niafũ wo ni di Filisti batii nnɛɛ. Kafɔɔ kanunua atootoso kale nwu ta Absalom oso. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Ninfɛ di Absalom wɔ buapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ bulɛ ale ni sɛka di suoto loo ntookpi di kakpɛ kamɛ nɛ. Ni be oso minoobuɛ ɔlaa kuonwii di ɔka okplesa ɔwako suoto?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Ni di Ɔka Dawid lata olebatatɛ Sadok ku Abiatar kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Kaalɛ Yuda banɔɔfo falɛ, ‘Be oso di aye nimale bayɛntɛle nimakplesa ɔka minwako ni lɛkayo nɔɔ, di obe wɔ di ɔlaa wɔ boobuɛ ni di Israel omuu ntoodu ni ɔka di leyo nɔɔ? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Babiloo-suɔtɔbi bile, suoto sina ku ntɔ nii mmu. Ni be oso nfɛ di aye nimale bayɛntɛle ba nimakplesa ɔka minwako ni?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Bikaalɛ Amasa bilɛ, ‘Diele suoto nii simu ku ntɔ nii mmu fale? Yaa anaanfi fɔ kootoko, bia ata diwɛ osie nwaa, nse diɛyɔ ni di nunua diesifi ni, ninanle afɔ ninle bakpɛtɛ nii kanyayilatɛ di Yoab kanya.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Ni di Dawid ɔlaa nwu lafũ Yuda basuɔtɔ bamuu situ fɛle osuɔtɔ onwii dile nɛ. Ni baata ɔka kanya alɛ, “Kple fawa, afɔ ku batii lɛfɔ bamuu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lakple aawa, ni aalaadu bia Yordan nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Nioso Yuda batii nwu lawa Gilgal alɛ bɔɔbakyakako ɔka mankpaa nwɔ manwaalɛsa Yordan okle. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Ni di Gera, Benyamin otii nwu niakye ni Bahurim obisuɔtɔbi Simei lapɛsɛwa aasoo baakyɛ ku Yuda batii nwu baalaakyakako Ɔka Dawid. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Manko Benyamin batii kakpe ku Siba wɔ niale ni Saul leyo kpɛmblatɛ, ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lefosi-banɔɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ afosi-anyɔ niakyɛ. Baakusa baalaadu Yordan di nfũ di ɔka lawɛ nii. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Baawaalɛ di kataalɛkɔ baalaakpaa ɔka leyo batii, mambla kafɔɔ lelele alɛ ɔɔbla.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2SA 19:18">Dawid Labla Sifutulɛ Aata Simei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Di Gera obisuɔtɔbi Simei lawaalɛ ni Yordan okle, ni aawakasɔ di ɔka anu <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Saate nii atanlo mi lɛpɔɔ. Tannyuma mmle di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ditalolaa abla ni di dii le di saate nii ɔka ladie ni di Yerusalem. Ɔka adiki ni di disi nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Diekye ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ n-ye nlɛ labla okpile. Kafɔɔ miɛ ntɔɔwa nfũ fɛ otii kasale di Yosef leyo nimuu kamɛ, lesoo lɛwa nlɛ kɔbakyakako saate nii ɔka.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Ninfɛ di Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Abisai labuɛ alɛ, “Bálaalo Simei ta nle mmle oso? Aakpaani nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Ni di Dawid ladiki kanya alɛ, “Aye Seruia babisuɔtɔbi, obe ninsi munko ye ntɛɛ? Miɛ dii le mmle bitookple bakyiditɛ nii! Dikaatɛ baalo otii owo di Israel miɛ? Nin-ye nlɛ miɛ, ami ninle ɔka di Israel suoto?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Nioso ɔka latɔkɔ Simei alɛ, “Flɔbakpi.” Ni di ɔka laka ntam aatɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Labla Sifutulɛ Aata Mefiboset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Saul ɔwa-suɔtɔbi, Mefiboset kafɔɔ lasoo aakyɛ aalaakyakako ɔka. Atafoto nkpaa nɔɔ ee akpaasu nfinfĩ nɔɔ ee afoto akleesaa nɔɔ diayɔ ni di dii le di ɔka ladie nii, dialaase di dii le di ɔka lakple aawa ni buɛɛ. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Obe wɔ aakye Yerualem aawa aabakyakako ni ɔka, ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Mefiboset, be oso fatatikanko mi buasifi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii ɔka, di ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle ni lɛbafa, labuɛ nlɛ, ‘Kamata manlolaa bɔkɛɛ nii wɔ nintuka ni atoo mantɛɛ, ninsiɛ nwɔ, di mmle kakyɛ ntikanko ni ɔka.’ Kafɔɔ kpɛmblatɛ nii Siba ladiki mi aata. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Ni aabalaa kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ aata saate nii ɔka nɛ. Saate nii ɔka nte fɛle Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ; nioso bla lelele ninlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Ɔwa nii suɔtɔ banantii diesiɛko lɛsalɛsaa di saate ni ɔka ɔkyɛ dilenkee kukpi. Kafɔɔ faata kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lɛba di mba ninle ni alesaa di opunu lɛfɔ suoto kamɛ. Nioso ɔmɛnsuku nkpe kakple nkaalɛ ɔka lɛsaa lewo?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso fankakatɛ fankyakaa? Latɔkɔ afɔ ku Siba nlɛ bisɛ afe nwu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Ni di Mefiboset latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Kanunua ka mmle di saate nii ɔka ntɔɔbabuo ni kafa buɛɛ yi, tɔɔ ayɔ lɛsaa biala.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Labla Sifutulɛ Aata Barsilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Ninfɛ di Barsilai, Gilead otii nwu kafɔɔ lasoo aakye Rogelim alɛ ɔɔlaawaalɛ Yordan okle ku ɔka, antɔɔ an-yɔ osuku nɔɔ ninfa ansifi. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Barsilai ntɔɔtɛ eebe, eefũ alɛɛ afosi-anɛ. Aanyu ɔka kanya di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni di Mahanaim. Diekye saawɛntɛ kplɛ di Barsilai lale. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ Barsilai alɛ, “Waalɛ ku ami faawa fabasiɛ di ɔkyɛ nii di Yerusalem, kamanyu fɔ kanya.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Kafɔɔ Barsilai lakaalɛ ɔka alɛ, “Alɛɛ asɛ kamakple nsiɛ nkpa fiɛ kakple nkata nsifi Yerusalem ku ɔka? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Kanunua ntoofũ alɛɛ afosi-anɛ. Kafuo nle ninle ni dibiene ku nle ninle ni dikpile otofo? Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kakple antofo nle oole ni ku nle oonyi ni ɔmɛnɛfɛ? Kakple nnu basuɔtɔ ku basanko sinu basantɛ sɛlɔ? Be oso di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamakple an-yɔ atoo ankyakaa saate nii ɔka? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamawaalɛ Yordan okle ku ɔka ankyɛnko nwɔ osuku kakuu, kafɔɔ be oso di ɔka katɛɛ letota di osuku wɔ mmle suoto? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ akple, alɛ kalaakpi di okpoo nii omu, di teemi ku yaami ɔkya ɔlɔɔkɔ. Kafɔɔ nnya kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Kimham. Tɔɔ aawaalɛ ku saate nii ɔka. Bla lelele ninlɛ fɔ fatɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Kimham kamawaalɛ ku ami, kamabla kafɔɔ lelele ninlɛ fɔ ntɔɔ. Lelele kafɔɔ foomiɛ fankyeko ɔkyɛ nii, kamabla nta fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Nioso batii nwu bamuu lawaalɛ Yordan okle, ni di ɔka kafɔɔ lawaalɛ nɛ. Ɔka lafĩfĩɔ Barsilai akpoo aatɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ, ni di Barsilai lakple aasifi leyo nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Di ɔka lawaalɛ aafe ni Gilgal, Kimham kafɔɔ lawaalɛ ku nnwɔɔ. Yuda bakpɛtɛ bamuu ku Israel bakpɛtɛ kakyɛ nwu niakpaa ɔka baawaalɛsa.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Ninfɛ di Israel batii bamuu latɔɔwa ɔka nfũ baabatɔɔkaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Lɛ oso di babiloo Yuda batii leyu ɔka ku leyo nɔɔ batii beesifiko bɛɛlaawaalɛsa Yordan, ku batii nɔɔ bamuu?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Ni di Yuda batii bamuu latɔkɔ Israel batii alɛ, “Buɔbla nle mmle diekye ɔka ɔnantii wɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ wo ni nwaa ale. Be oso di ɔblɔ kofiɛ ye ninwu suoto? Butoole ɔka alesaa awo? Buɔyɔ lɛsaa lewo buɔta suoto loo?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Ninfɛ di Israel batii latɔkɔ Yuda batii alɛ, “Bukpe nlekɔ lefosi di ɔka kamɛ; diɛkyakaa nii, bukpe kasiɛkɔ kplɛ di Dawid kamɛ bulenke ye. Ni lɛ oso bionyu wo nyakatãa nkpo? Diele awo niale bakasale buakakatɛ ni di ɔka okplesa ɔwako suoto?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Kafɔɔ Yuda batii lamunikĩisa ma ku ɔblɔ bia baalenkee Israel batii.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Seba Lataka Aayila Di Dawid Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Ninfɛ di kudu-kpeetɛ onwii manlɛɛ ni Seba niale ni Bikri obisuɔtɔbi aale ni Benyamin otii lawɛ ninfa. Ni aafɛ kakyukyoe osie kanya alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Bunaa kalekɔ kukanwii di Dawid kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">lɛba kuninwii di Yese obisuɔtɔbi kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Oo Israel, otii biala asifi lɛkpaayo nɔɔ!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Nioso Israel batii bamuu lakyɛ baadiɛ Dawid, baalaatikanko Bikri obisuɔtɔbi Seba. Kafɔɔ Yuda batii lawɛ di ɔka lɛma ɔkyɛ, diayɔ ni di Yordan dialaadu ni Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Di Dawid lakple aawa ni lɛkayo nɔɔ di Yerusalem, ni aalaakpee basɔnɔ nɔɔ lefosi ba aadiɛ aatɛ alɛ batoonyu ni lɛkayo nwu leeyo, di banyuntɛ kanyu kalɔ nɛ. Ɔka latoonyu ma kanya, kafɔɔ atatenko ma. Aakpee ma leeyo fɛ bakpisɔfɔ dialaase di dikpiyi lɛma.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Amasa alɛ, “Lɛɛ Yuda batii falɛ baawa ɔkyɛ nii di ayi atiɛ kamɛ, faawɛ ninfũ afɔ omu.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Kafɔɔ di Amasa lafe ni Yuda batii ɔlɛɛ, aaklɛ aalenkee obe wɔ di ɔka lɛtɛ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Abisai alɛ, “Kanunua ka mmle, Bikri obisuɔtɔbi Seba kamabla wo dikpile anlenkee nle di Absalom labla nii. Kpaa saate lɛfɔ bakpɛtɛ bietikanko nwɔ, se diele nkpo abamiɛ sekpoo se beetofo seyoyiɛ beekyisa ni antoso ansifi nfa andiɛ wo.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Nioso Yoab bakpɛtɛ ku Keret batii ku Pelet batii ku bakpɛtɛ siene bamuu ladie, di Abisai lale ma ni kanyayilatɛ. Baakyɛ baadie di Yerusalem baalaati Bikri obisuɔtɔbi Seba.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Obe wɔ baawɛ ni di Gibeon difuɔ kplɛ katũ, Amasa lawa aabakyakako ma. Yoab lakpee kakpɛ nɔɔ akpeele, aakpakũ akpakyaa ku kapamii di kopoo nika kamɛ. Aadiki ni kɔkpaa, ni di kapamii labɔkɔtɛ di kopoo nika nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Ni di Yoab lasɛɛsa Amasa alɛ, “Obiloo, sikpe fɔ osie?” Ninfɛ di Yoab lamufũ Amasa di okusu ku koletanɛɛ nɔɔ aafĩfĩɔ nwɔ akpoo nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amasa ditatoonyu suoto ku kapamii nɔɔ ka di Yoab kɔnɛɛ, ni di Yoab layɔ ka aatofo Amasa di kafutu nɛ, sɛfɔtɔ nɔɔ ladie siate kaasɔ. Atasinsafɔ nwɔ aakyakaa fiɛ di Amasa lakpi. Ninfɛ di Yoab ku obilɛma Abisai latikanko Bikri obisuɔtɔbi Seba nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Yoab kpɛtɛ onwii layila di Amasa ɔlɔɔkɔ ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Olele nimbɔmbɔ Yoab, ku olele ninle ni Dawid ole, bitɔɔ atikanko Yoab! <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa late di ntɔ nɔɔ kamɛ aatɔɔkpɛ di osuku ntɛɛntɛɛ, ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lanya alɛ bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu lawa baabayila ninfa nɛ. Aanya alɛ otii biala niedu Amasa nnyila nii, ni aananfi nwɔ aakyisa di osuku nwu aalaatɛ di lepoo kamɛ, aafukuti dibula aatĩi nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Baakyisa Amasa di osuku baaloo nii, basuɔtɔ nwu bamuu layefe osuku ku Yoab baati Bikri obisuɔtɔbi Seba.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Seba lafenfe di Israel ana amuu kamɛ aabadu Abel Bet Maaka, aafe kafɔɔ di Beri batii kasɔ kamuu, ni baasi kanya baatikanko nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Ninfɛ di Yoab bakpɛtɛ bamuu lawa baabamana baakyi Seba di Bet Maaka nɛ. Baapɛ ditii baakyisa baalaadunko okpoo kplɛ nwu, diawɛ di kayi oyoyiɛ wɔ baatofo ni suoto. Di obe wɔ baatoototofo ni oyoyiɛ nwu alɛ boobiɛ nwu nii. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Ni di ɔsanko numbentɛ onwii lafaa di okpoo kplɛ nwu aabuɛ alɛ, “Binu! Binu! Bitɔkɔ Yoab bilɛ awa ninfũ ninkakatɛ ntɔɔ.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Ni di Yoab latoofe ɔsanko nwu ɔkyɛ nɛ, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Afɔ ninle Yoab nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Ami nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nu ɔlaa wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamabuɛ ni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ni di Yoab labuɛ alɛ, “Konu.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Saa, mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Bilaakaalɛ lɛsɔnu di Abel,’ ni ninkyɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Awo ninle atoko ɔkyɛ ole ku onukwale batii di Israel nɛ. Foomiɛ falɛ fɔɔwɔɔsa okpoo kplɛ wɔ ninle ni Israel kɔya. Be oso foomiɛ falɛ famɛ SAATE nwu atesaa?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Ni di Yoab ladiki kanya alɛ, “Dikyɛ lookyo di suoto nii! Dikyɛ lookyo di suoto nii, alɛ kawɔɔsa ee mmɛ nwu! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Diele nkpo di ɔlaa nwu nte. Osuɔtɔ onwii ninle ni Bikri obisuɔtɔbi manlɛɛ ni Seba, niekye ni Efraim lekpenkpe kale niɛtakatɛ kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ di ɔka Dawid suoto. Bidiki osuɔtɔ nwu lete bita, ni kamadie di okpoo kplɛ nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Babayɔ disi nɔɔ man-yu manfenko di oyoyiɛ nwu manta fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lasifi batii bamuu nfũ ku ninumbe nɔɔ nwu sɛlaa, ni baabudi Bikri obisuɔtɔbi Seba disi baayɔ ni baayu baata Yoab nɛ. Nioso Yoab lafɛ kakyukyoe, ni di batii nɔɔ lakyɛ di okpoo kplɛ nwu suoto nɛ. Obiala lasifi leyo nɔɔ. Ni di Yoab lakple aasifi ɔka nfũ di Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Banɔɔfotii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoab niayila di Israel bakpɛtɛ bamuu kanya; Yoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia niayila di Keret batii ku Pelet batii kanya; <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoniram niatoonyu mba boonyinka alɛ babla ni sɛkpɛ; Ahilud obisuɔtɔbi Yosafat niale asaa katɛkɔ nsũtɛtɛ; <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sewa niale kukũ kpanatɛ; Sadok ku Abiata niale olebatatɛ; <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />ni di Yairi otii, Ira kafɔɔ lale oletatɛ aata Dawid nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Baalo Saul Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Obe wɔ kamɛ di Dawid latoole ni sɛka, kɔka lakpɛ alɛɛ atiɛ amu; nioso Dawid lakaalɛ SAATE nwu aanu. Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Saul ku leyo nɔɔ batii ba niakpe ni ntɔ oso; diekye aalo Gibeon batii.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ni di ɔka lalɛɛ Gibeon batii aakakatɛ aata ma nɛ. (Gibeon batii ditale Israel batii, kafɔɔ Amor batii ba niabu baasiɛ ni nkpa baale. Israel batii laka ntam alɛ babadiɛ ma mansiɛ nkpa, kafɔɔ Saul di okyiini wɔ aawɛ ata ni Israel ku Yuda oso, aamiɛ alɛ ɔɔwɔɔsa ma.) <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakaalɛ Gibeon batii alɛ, “Obe nimbla nta ye? Lɛ kanya kabunka ye, alɛ biata lɛtɔtrɔ di SAATE nwu atesaa suoto?"<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Ni di Gibeon batii latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Bunaa osuku munkaalɛ koto fututu ee koto sɛɛle munkyeko Saul ee leyo nɔɔ batii ɔkyɛ, ee bukpe osuku munlo otii owo di Israel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Obe Biomiɛ bilɛ mbla nta ye?"<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ wɔ niawɔɔsa wo ni, aadieko wo nii, oso batoodiki wo ni kaamɛ, alɛ bunaa ni lɛba kuninwii di Israel kakɔkaakɔ yi, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />ta bata wo basuɔtɔ nɔɔ bakuɛnsĩ bulo busaka di SAATE nwu anu di Gibea ninle ni Saul-nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lediki ni okpoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Nioso ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Kamadiki ma nta ye.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Ta ntam lɛka le niasiɛ ni di Dawid ku Saul obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan ntɛɛ oso, ɔka Dawid ladiɛ Saul obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan obisuɔtɔbi Mefiboset aasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Kafɔɔ ɔka lakpaa Aia obisankobi Rispa babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ ba aalofo aata ni Saul, Armoni ku Mefiboset, ku Saul obisankobi Merab babisuɔtɔbi banɔɔ ba aalofo aata ni Mehola otii nwu, niale ni Barsilai obisuɔtɔbi Adriel. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Ni aayɔ ma aakpee di Gibeon batii nnɛɛ nɛ. Baalo ma baasaka di lekpenkpe suoto di SAATE nwu anu. Bakuɛnsĩ lɛma nwu bamuu lasi baanɔɔ. Baalo ma di asaa ofeebee ayi kasale nwu kamɛ, di atita ofeebee lakye okye kasɔ.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Ninfɛ di Aia obisankobi Rispa layɔ leboko, aafukuti ni aatika di difuɔ aata suoto nɔɔ. Diayɔ ni di asaa ofeebee kasɔ kakyekɔ dialaadu ni obe wɔ di kanto lanɔɔ aakye osi aakpete ni di bakpi nwu suoto. Ɔsanko nwu ditaata kɔfɛɛfɔ bakansiɛ lakpanko ma di kakũ ee lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ku kakyɛ. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Dawid lɛsaa le di Saul ɔsɔnɔ, Aia obisankobi Rispa labla nii, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />ni di Dawid lakyɛ aalaafũ Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan akufi di Yabes Gilead batii nnɛɛ nɛ. (Baayu akufi nwu baayɔ di Bet San okpoo lɛkpaka, di lɛba le di Filisti batii lasaka ma nii, di obe wɔ baalo ni Saul di Gilboa baaloo ni sɛmaa.) <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Ni di Dawid layɔ Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan akufi aakyeko nfa, ku mba baasaka baalo ni akufi aasiisa nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ni baakookaa Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan akufi di Saul ote Kis ɔkya kamɛ di Sela di Benyamin kasɔ suoto nɛ. Baabla lɛsaa biala le di ɔka labuɛ nii. Nni kamaa, Yaa lanu ɔlaa ɔpɛ wɔ baapɛ ni di kasɔ nwu disi.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakpɛ Di Filisti Batii Kyokyodikyo Suoto</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 20.4-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Kakpɛ lakple kaadie di Filisti batii ku Israel ntɛɛ. Dawid lasoo aakyɛ ku batii nɔɔ baalaakpɛko Filisti batii, ni diabuo Dawid nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ni di Isbi-Benob, niale ni Rafa ɔnantii onwii wɔ di lɛbɔɔsaa lɛkplɔ nɔɔ disi onutũ lawo ni bakilo batiɛ ku kakyɛ, aaklee ni kapamii fɔle labuɛ alɛ abalo Dawid. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Kafɔɔ Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Abisai lawa aabafũ Dawid; aasafɔ Filisti otii nwu aatɛ kaasɔ aalo nwɔ. Ninfɛ di Dawid batii laka ntam baata Abisai baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Diidii flɔbasinkyɛ kakpɛ ku awo, ta mmle di Israel kandiɛ dilɔbanii ni oso.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Di kakpɛ ka mmle sɛmaa, kakpɛ bamba lakple kaadie ku Filisti batii di Gob. Di obe nwu kamɛ di Sibekai niale ni Husa otii lalo Saf wɔ niale ni Rafa ɔnantii onwii lɛma.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Di kakpɛ bamba ku Filisti batii di Gob yi, ni di Betlehem otii nwu, Yaare-Oregim obisuɔtɔbi Elhanan lalo Gat otii nwu, Goliat wɔ di lɛkplɔ nɔɔ kakleekɔ late ni fɛle abula losotɛ kawesee.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Di kakpɛ bamba kafɔɔ baakpɛ ni di Gat, osuɔtɔ kyokyodikyo onwii lawɛ ku anɛɛbi akuɔ di kɔnɛɛ biala ku akpɛɛbi akuɔ di kɔkpaa biala- amuu labla afosi-anyɔ-ana. Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ Rafa kɔna kamɛ aakye. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Aatootutufa ni Israel, ni di Dawid obilɛma Simea obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan lalo nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Batii bana ba mmle lale Rafa banantii di Gat, baanɔɔ kakpɛ di Dawid ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lelenkee Onu</para>
  <para style="r">(Onu 18)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Dawid lasa onu wɔ mmle sɛlaa aata SAATE nwu, di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu ladiki nwɔ aakyeko ni balo nɔɔ bamuu ku Saul nnɛɛ. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“SAATE nwu ninle mi difuɔnkpaa, kɔba nii ku dikitɛ nii;<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Yaa nii ninle mi difuɔnkpaa, nnwɔɔ kamɛ nintaniko nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">kubidifunsaa nii ku didiki nii lɛkya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Nnwɔɔ ninle sientɛ nii, katanikokɔ nii ku dikitɛ nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">feefũ mi di amumu batii nnɛɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Lɛlɛɛ SAATE nwu, nnwɔ di katansa lesiɛko nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">ni eediki mi di balo nii nnɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />“Kukpi afɛɛfɔ ɔfɛ lamana mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">ntu siene ninlalasa ni asaa lakpee mi difu.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Ɔkya sikũ lamimini mi siakyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">kukpi akyĩ ladieko mi.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Di nimiina nii kamɛ lalɛɛ SAATE nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">lafaa lalɛɛ Yaa nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Aanu mi sɛlɔ di olekatakɔ nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">lɛfaa nii labuo di atoko nɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />“Kasɔ lakpanko suoto, kaatũkũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">osi n-yilakɔ latũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">aakpanko suoto diekye ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Kɔyɔ ladie di anwunfie nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">ɔtɔ wɔ ninfiɛ ni asaa ladie di kanya nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">atɔkɔnii bembe ladie aakye ka kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Aabɛ osi, aasoo aawa kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">ditunu alokonkyɛ lawɛ di nkpaasɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Aasiɛ di Kerubim suoto aaflɛlɛtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">aaflɛlɛtɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ afoko suoto.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Aayɔ ditunu aabla akpanta nɔɔ aakyisa suoto-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">fɛle kanto ditunu alokonkyɛ koolo.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Lɛkpa nwu di anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">di atɔkɔnii ya nikomunaa ni ladie aakye.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />SAATE nwu lakpududuu aakyeko osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">ni di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni sɛlɔ ladie nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Aataa kɔtaa aasamiisa balo nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">aata ɔtɔ lamumuna kuakpɔkpɔtɔsa ma.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Lekpo kalɔ sisuku ladie siate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">kasɔ asɔse kafɔɔ late temple,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">di SAATE nwu ɔlaa osĩ ɔta kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">di anwunfie nɔɔ ninwuna hɛɛhɛɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Aakyɔɔ kɔnɛɛ kuakye katoo kuabamufũ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">aananfi mi aadiki di ntu kyofole kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Aadiki mi aakyeko balo nii siene nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">di bakyiditɛ nii ba niawɛ osie baalenkee mi ni nnɛɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Baadieko mi di dii le di ɔlaa latũ mi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">kafɔɔ SAATE nwu niale mi kamaayilatɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Aakpaa mi aawako lɛba le niɛblɛfɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">aadiki mi, diekye labuo nwɔ anu.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“SAATE nwu lɛbla ɛɛtɛɛ di ɔsaabla tinini nii kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">nnɛɛ nii leklekle kanya oso, ɛɛtɛɛ letota.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Diekye lelolaa nkyɛ di SAATE nwu sisuku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">nimbla okpile nkyi di Yaa nii kamaa.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Afiofa nɔɔ amuu nte di anu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">nindiɛ ɔkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Aanyako mi ɔlaa kuonwii di anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">lɛblasa suoto nii di sikpile ɔbla suoto.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />SAATE nwu lɛtɛɛ letota di ɔsaabla tinini nii kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">ta mmle di nnɛɛ ni leklekle ni di anu nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Mba ninle ni onukwale fandiki onukwale lɛfɔ fantuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">mba suoto di ole nnaa nii, faatuo falɛ banaa ole kuonwii,<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />suoto lɛfɔ lɛkpa kɔmɛ di mba suoto niɛkpa ni kɔmɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">kafɔɔ bakpileblatɛ, fannya ma nyaami.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Afɔ nindiki batii ba niɛwakosa ni suoto kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">kafɔɔ fanwakosa mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo kasɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Oo SAATE, afɔ ninle kandiɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">SAATE nwu mmunikĩisa ditunu nii ambla lɛkpa.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Ku lɛkyakaako lɛfɔ kamafuo bakpɛtɛ dikudi olenkee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">ku Yaa nii lɛkyakaako kamafuo oyoyiɛ oyefe.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />“Yaa nnwɔɔ, osuku nɔɔ lewo nimu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">SAATE nwu ɔlaa lɛkpa kɔmɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Kubidifunsaa ale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">ata batii ba bamuu niɛtaniko nwɔ nii.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Diekye owe ninle Yaa di SAATE nwu kamaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Owe kafɔɔ ninle Difuɔnkpaa nwu alenkee Yaa loo?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Yaa ninle nnwɔ ninkpee mi ni osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">anta osuku nii kafɔɔ nnwo nimu.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Ɛɛbla nkpaa nii fɛle kafɛ̀ nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">antɛɛ n-yila di ntakalekɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Eetuo nnɛɛ nii kakpɛ ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">alɛ nnɛɛ nii kafuo abɔɔsaa kɔtaa obonsa.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Fɛɛtɛɛ lelenkee kubidifunsaa lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">afɔ niɛwakasɔ, fɛɛtakatɛ mi katoo.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Fɛɛblɛfɛsa osuku fɛɛta nkpaa nii kasekɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">mmle ninaakpɔnɔɔsa ni lɛnankpo.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />“Lati balo nii lalaalenkee ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">ntakple nkpaamaa dialaase di obe wɔ lawɔɔsa ma nii.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Labibiɛ ma wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ, batasinfuo ɔtaka kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">baanɔɔ di nkpaa nii kalɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Faayɔ osie faaminisa mi faata kakpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">faata mba nin-yɛ ni di suoto nii lakpee asi kaasɔ di nkpaatũ nii.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Faata balo nii lamunikĩisa mmaa lɛma baatoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">ni lawɔɔsa bakyiditɛ nii nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Baawi alɛ bakyakaako ma, kafɔɔ kuonwii ditawɛ abafũ ma nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">baalɛɛ SAATE nwu, kafɔɔ atakpee ma kanya.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Labibiɛ ma nwaa fɛ kudu kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">lawuwuo, lananafu ma fɛle apatampata di akpaka.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Fatoodiki mi feekyeko batii nii ba nindieko mi nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">fɛɛyɔ mi fɛɛbla fɛ nnle nwu disi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">batii ba ninan-ye ni nfɛ ninsi kaalɔ nii,<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />bafɔɔ n-wa mamawakasɔ mantɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">nse beenu mi onu ɔlaa, mankyɔɔ mi atoko.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Bamuu lɛma situ kobiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">mankye di nwofakɔ lɛma manwa ku ditũtũkũ.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“SAATE nwu nkpe nkpa! Baatansa Difuɔnkpaa nii nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Baatakatɛsa Yaa, Difuɔnkpaa nwu ku Dikitɛ nii nwu katoo!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Ale Yaa wɔ nimbla ankyisa antɛɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">nnwɔ nin-yɔ nnle nwu ankpee ni di kalɔ nii,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />nnwɔ nindiki mi ankyeko ni balo nii nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Fantakatɛsa mi katoo fanlenkee bakyiditɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">fanfũ mi fankyeko amumu batii nnɛɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Oo SAATE, nioso kamatansa fɔ di nnle nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">kamasa sinu ntansa leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Anta ɔka nɔɔ lelenkee kplɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">ambla sifutulɛ nɔɔ se ninaa ni kaloo anta nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">ambla anta Dawid ku banantii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Sɛlaa Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Nnya Dawid sɛlaa yɛntɛle ninle nse mmle nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">“Yese obisuɔtɔbi Dawid ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">osuɔtɔ wɔ di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni latakatɛsa ni katoo ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">osuɔtɔ wɔ di Yakob Yaa lapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Israel sinu bawolatɛ:<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“SAATE nwu Ninwuna lakakatɛ aafenko di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">ɔlaa nɔɔ latika di ɔkplalomii nii.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Israel Yaa nwu lakakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Israel Difuɔnkpaa nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Nse otii lele sɛka di batii suoto di ɔsaabla tinini kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">nse eele sɛka di Yaa lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />ate fɛle olesɛ lɛkpa di kufĩ katunkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">di olesɛ wɔ di alokonkyɛ nnaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">fɛle lɛkpa le di kanto lɛnɔɔ sɛmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">ninta sɛfa n-yie ni kaasɔ.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />“Diele leyo nii ninte tinini di Yaa anu nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Atanii kanya ka ninaa ni kaloo ku ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">eelolaa ka ɛɛtɛ ni di lɛsaa biala kanya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Ɔlɔbata didiki nii lɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">atɛɛ kafɔɔ dibiesaa nii biala?<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Kafɔɔ babafuki batii kpile bamuu mantɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ fɛle siwuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">se mananlɛ ni ku nnɛɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Otii lele ninkpanko siwuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">n-yɔ lɛbɔɔsaa ee lɛkplɔ owoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">anfiɛ sĩ di lɛba le sinte nii.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Bakpɛtɛ Siene Nwu</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro 11.10-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Nnya Dawid basuɔtɔ siene nwu ayooto: Tahkemon otii nwu, Yoseb Basebet niale ɔnɔɔfo di Batiɛ nwu kamɛ. Aatakatɛsa lɛkplɔ nɔɔ katoo di batii alafa-anɛ suoto, aalo ma di didieko ninwii kamɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Nnwɔ niatikanko nwɔ ni niale Ahohi otii nwu, Dodo obisuɔtɔbi Eleasar. Fɛ basientɛ nwu batiɛ onwii lɛma yi, aawɛ ku Dawid fiɛ baalaatutufa Filisti batii ba niasi ni dikudi di Pas Damim baata ni kakpɛ. Ninfɛ di Israel batii lakple nkpaamaa nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Kafɔɔ aayila kpinkpĩ aaloloo Filisti batii dialaase di obe wɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ labetii kuayila ni, di kapamii lanukaakaa ni di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ suoto. SAATE nwu lata ma lelenkee kplɛ di dii nwu suoto. Ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu lakple baasifi Eleaser nfũ, kafɔɔ baakyɛ alɛ bɔɔlaadidiki asaa di bakpi nwu suoto.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Nnwɔ niatikanko nwɔ ni niale Harar otii nwu, Age obisuɔtɔbi Sama. Obe wɔ di Filisti batii lasiisa ni bawo di kofe kunwii niayii ni ku aketeku yi, Israel bakpɛtɛ latoso baadiɛ ma. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Kafɔɔ Sama layila kpinkpĩ di kofe nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ. Aakpɛ aata kũ, ni aaloloo Filisti batii aatɛ nɛ. SAATE nwu kafɔɔ lata lelenkee kplɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Di alesaa ofeebee kamɛ, batii batiɛ di afosi-atiɛ nwu kamɛ lawa Dawid nfũ di Adulam ofuɔntuu, di obe wɔ di Filisti batii dikudi lasiɛ ni di Refaim Ɔtaata. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Dawid lawɛ di katanikokɔ nwu, Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ nwu kafɔɔ lawɛ di Betlehem. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Otukɔnsɔ laklee Dawid osie kanya, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Oo, alɛ otii owo atɛɛ ntu di ditubiɔ le ninkaako ni Betlehem kayoko nnyi!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Nioso basuɔtɔ basientɛ batiɛ nwu labɛ Filisti batii kamɛ baafe, baalaadu ntu di ditubiɔ nwu ninkaako ni Betlehem kayoko baawako Dawid. Kafɔɔ aasĩ mi onyi; kafɔɔ, aanyɛɛnɛ mi aatɛ di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Oo SAATE, ta dikyɛ diokyo di suoto nii, alɛ kabla nle mmle! Diele batii ntɔ niɛyɔ nkpa lɛma bɛɛta, bɛɛkyɛ?” Nioso Dawid dilɔbanyi mi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Nkpo di basiɛntɛ batiɛ nwu labla nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Yoab obilɛma Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Abisai niale ɔnɔɔfo di afosi atiɛ nwu kamɛ. Aatakatɛ lɛkplɔ nɔɔ katoo di batii alafa-atiɛ suoto, aalo ma, nioso aabale otii finle fɛ batii Batiɛ nwu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Batatɔɔ dibu baalenkee Batiɛ nwu? Aabale ma kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ, nu atasiɛ kaamɛ lɛma.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia lale kpɛtɛ wɔ niawɛ ni sɛkambi aakye ni Kabseel, aabla ni asiensaa kplɛ. Aalo Moab basientɛ nwaa banyɔ. Aasoo kafɔɔ aakyɛ dibiɔ kamɛ aalaalo kyata di atubakani ɔkpakpaa dii suoto diakplɔkplɔ nii. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Aalo kafɔɔ Egipte otii kyokyodikyo onwii. Nu di Egipte otii nwu laklee lɛkplɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ yi, Benaia labuo nwɔ di suoto ku kawosoku. Aaklee lɛkplɔ aafũ di Egipte otii nwu kɔnɛɛ, ni aalo Egipte otii nwu ku nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ lɛkplɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Nkpo kanya di Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia labla asiensaa nɛ. Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aale otii finle fɛ basiɛntɛ nwu batiɛ. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Baatɔɔ dibu kplɛ baalenkee Afosi-atiɛ nwu lele. Kafɔɔ atasiɛ di Batiɛ nwu kamɛ. Ni di Dawid layɔ nwɔ aase di banyuntɛ nɔɔ kanya nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Di Afosi-atiɛ nwu kamɛ niale:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:24">Yoab obilɛma Asahel,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:24">Dodo obisuɔtɔbi Elhanan niakye ni Betlehem,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Sama, Harod otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:25">Elika, Harod otii nwu,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Heles, Palt otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:26">Ikes obisuɔtɔbi Ira wɔ niakye ni Tekoa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abieser wɔ niakye ni Anatot,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:27">Mebunai, Husat otii nwu,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salmon, Ahoh otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:28">Maharai, Netofat otii nwu, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Netofat otii nwu, Baana obisuɔtɔbi Heleb,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:29">Ribai obisuɔtɔ Itai wɔ niakye ni Gibea di Benyamin kasɔ suoto,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaia, Piraton otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:30">Hidai wɔ niakye ni Gaas kɔwɛ,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abi-Albon, Ariba otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:31">Asmawet, Barhum otii nwu,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliahba, Saalbon otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:32">Yasen babisuɔtɔbi,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:32">Yonatan, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Sama obisuɔtɔbi Harar otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:33">Sarar obisuɔtɔbi Ahiam Harar otii nwu,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Ahasbai obisuɔtɔbi Elifelet, Maakat otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:34">Ahitofel obisuɔtɔbi Eliam, Gilo otii nwu,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hesrai, Karmel otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:35">Paarai, Arbi otii nwu,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Natan obisuɔtɔbi Yigal wɔ niakye ni Soba,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:36">Hagri obisuɔtɔbi,<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Selek, Amon otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:37">Naharai, Beerot otii nwu, niale ni Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab akpɛsaa-kleetɛ,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira, Yitri otii nwu,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:38">Gareb, Yitri otii nwu, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />ku Uria, Heti otii nwu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 23:39">Bamuu labla afosi-atiɛ-bakuɛnsĩ.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lata Baaka Bakpɛtɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro. 21.1-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Ɔblɔ lakple kuafiɛ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu di Israel suoto, ni aata Dawid lakpee ma aadiki, aabuɛ alɛ, “Kyɛ faalaaka Israel ku Yuda bakpɛtɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Nioso ɔka latɔkɔ Yoab ku bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ ba di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bikyi biefenfe di Israel ana amuu, diɛyɔ ni di Dan diɛlaase ni di Beerseba, biɛka basuɔtɔ bakpɛtɛ nwu, di mmle katofo ma ni lɛpɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Kafɔɔ Yoab latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “<char style="nd">Saate </char> Yaa lɛfɔ akpɛnsa bakpɛtɛ nwu alenkee kɔlafa kanya, di saate nii ɔka anu anya ni. Kafɔɔ be oso di saate nii komiɛ alɛ abla lɛsaa le mmle?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Ɔka ɔlaa nwu kafɔɔ lalenkee Yoab ku kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ nwu; nioso baakyɛ di ɔka anu baasifi alɛ bɔɔlaaka Israel batii bakpɛtɛ nwu.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Baawaalɛ Yordan okle baaloo nii, baasiɛ di Aroer ɔlɔɔkɔ, okpoo nwu kala kasɔ di kɔwɛ nwu, ninfɛ baafenfe di Gad baafe baasifi Yaser. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Baakyɛ Gilead ku Tatim Hodsi kasɔ suoto, baafe baasifi Dan Yaan baakyi ku Sidon. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Ninfɛ baafe baakyɔɔ anu Tiro seyoyiɛ ku Hewi batii ku Kanaan batii sekpoo simuu. Lɛyɛntɛle, baafe baakyɛ Beeseba di Yuda kasɔ ka bɔɔlɛɛ ni Negef.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Baakyi kasɔ kamuu baaloo nii, baakple baasifi Yerusalem di awɛntɛ anaasĩ ku ayi afosi-anyɔ kayɛntɛkɔ.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Ni di Yoab layɔ bakpɛtɛ nwu lɛpɔ aawako ɔka nɛ: Di Israel, basuɔtɔ ba nikafuo ni kapamii ɔkpɛ ɔblako baawɛ ni suoto, labla nkpe alafa-anɛ, di Yuda, nkpe alafa-anɔɔ.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Kafɔɔ Dawid otu lakpa, di bakpɛtɛ nwu ɔka sɛmaa, ni aatɔkɔ SAATE nwu alɛ, “Lɛbla okpile kplɛ di lɛsaa le lɛbla nii. Oo SAATE, lekoto kotikiti fɔ, yɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ okpile fakyɛ nwɔ. Lɛbla dibuusaa kplɛ ninwii.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Fiɛ di Dawid lataka ni kaleesɛ ku oyita, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Dawid asaanyatɛ, ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Gad alɛ: <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Kyɛ faalaatɔkɔ Dawid falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni: Kamatɛ fɔ ɛlaa etiɛ di anu. Diki onwii ninwu, nin-yɔ nwu mbla fɔ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Nioso Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Gad lakyɛ Dawid nfũ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kɔka kukpɛ di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto alɛɛ atiɛ ɛɛ? Sɛɛ faatoototoso balo lɛfɔ awɛntɛ atiɛ, di obe wɔ batikanko fɔ ni ɛɛ? Sɛɛ ofiɛ kpile di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto ayi atiɛ? Kanunua, bu nwu disi nfɛ, faatɔkɔ mi mmle ninaatɔkɔ ni nnwɔ niekpee mi ni kɔtɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Gad alɛ, “Nsi di nimiina kplɛ kamɛ osie kanya. Ta SAATE nwu ananfi wo kootoko, diekye nyaami nɔɔ ɔnya lemuɔ; kafɔɔ tanta batii lananfi mi kootoko.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Nioso SAATE nwu lata ofiɛ kpile lawa di Israel, diayɔ ni di olesɛ nwu dialaadu ni di obe wɔ aatɛ nii. Ni diayɔ ni di Dan dialaadu ni Beeseba batii ba niakpi ni labla nkpe afosi-akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Di tɔkyɛntɛ nwu lananfi ni kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ alɛ ɔɔwɔɔsa ni Yerusalem yi, SAATE nwu labuo sɛnyaami, ta letoko naanfi nwu oso. Ni aatɔkɔ tɔkyɛntɛ wɔ niatɔɔta ni batii nwu ofiɛ alɛ, “Nfɛ dilɛ! Kplesa kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ.” Obe nwu SAATE nwu tɔkyɛntɛ nfɛ nkpe di Arauna, Yebusi otii nwu kakpaa.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Di Dawid lanya ni tɔkyɛntɛ wɔ niatoolo ni batii, ni aatɔkɔ SAATE nwu alɛ, “Ami ninle nnwɔ niabla ni okpile, nintalolaa labla nii. Batii ba mmle ninte ni fɛle bafoso, obe bɛɛbla? Ta letoko naanfi lɛfɔ diwa di suoto nii ku leyo nii batii suoto.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lapɛ Oleɔta Akyikye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Di dii nwu nkpo, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Gad lakyɛ Dawid nfũ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kata faakyɛ faalaapɛ SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye di Arauna, Yebusi otii nwu kakpaa.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Nioso Dawid lakata aakyɛ fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu ladiki ni kanya aafenko ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Gad suoto. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Obe wɔ di Arauna lanyu, aanya ni ɔka ku batii nɔɔ kɔwa ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, ni aadie aalaawakasɔ di ɔka anu, aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Ni di Arauna labuɛ alɛ, “Be oso di saate nii ɔka kɔwa kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ɔkyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Ninfɛ di Dawid ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kɔbaya kakpaa lɛfɔ, di mmle kapɛ ni oleɔta akyikye nta ni SAATE nwu, alɛ ofiɛ kpile nwu kadiɛ ni batii ɔpɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Ni di Arauna latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Ta saate nii ɔka ayɔ lelele ninlɛ nwɔ ni, aayɔ ata. Nnya banankyue ba baata ni ɔfiɛ asaaɔta, nnya kafɔɔ kamɔɔ ɔpɛ sewoso ku banankyue sewoso se mananfi ni, diɛta ni ɔtɔ okutaa. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />O ɔka, Arauna lɛyɔ n-ya mmle amuu ɛɛta ɔka.” Arauna latɔkɔ nwɔ kafɔɔ alɛ, “SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ afũ fɔ kanya.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Kafɔɔ ɔka nwu labunka Arauna alɛ, “Oowo, letuna nlɛ kamata koto nta fɔ. Namata oleɔta wɔ ninan-ya ni lɛsaalɛsaa n-yɔ nta ɔfiɛ asaaɔta nta ni SAATE, Yaa nii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Nioso Dawid laya kakpaa nwu ku banankyue nwu aata nya koto fututu afosi anɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Ni di Dawid lapɛ oleɔta akyikye aata SAATE nwu ninfa, aata ɔfiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta oleɔta nɛ. Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latuna di ɔlaa ɔpɛ nwu di kasɔ nwu disi nɛ. Ni di ofiɛ kpile nwu di Israel suoto ladiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>